  <para style="h">Yosuwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu ca Yosuwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yosuwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yos</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu ca</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yosuwa</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yosuwa ahabwa kurongora ihanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amaze gupfa, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabariye Yosuwa mwene Nuni, uwahora afasha Mose ibikorwa ati: <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />“Umusavyi wanje Mose yapfuye. None rero mwe n’aba bantu mwese nimwitegure, mujabuke uruzi Yorodani, muje mu gihugu mpaye Abisirayeli. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />Aho muzohonyoza ikirenge hose ndahabahaye nk’uko nabisezeraniye Mose. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />Igihugu canyu kizotangurira ku bugaragwa bw’i Libani no ku ruzi runini ari rwo Efurate, harimwo n’intara y’Abaheti, gushika ku Kiyaga Mediterane, mu burengero. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" />Nta wuzoshobora kuguhangara ngo akugwanye igihe cose ushigaje kubaho. Nk’uko nabanye na Mose, ni ko nzobana nawe. Sinzokureka wenyene, sinzoguhemukira. <verse eid="JOS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />Komera kandi shira ubwoba, kuko ari wewe uzojana aba bantu kugira ngo begukire igihugu nasezeraniye ba sekuruza nkabarahira ko nzokibaha.<verse eid="JOS 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />Komere wongere ushire ubwoba. Witwararike kwumvira ivyagezwe vyose umusavyi wanje Mose yaguhaye; ntuzohengamire i buryo canke i bubamfu, ni ho uzoshobora kwama ushika ku ntumbero yawe aho uzoja hose. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Amajambo ari muri iki Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe ntaze yigere ava mu kanwa kawe. Uze wame uyiyumvirako ku murango no mw’ijoro, kugira ngo uzoshobore kwumvira ivyanditsemwo vyose. Ni ho uzoshobora kwama uja imbere, ugashika ku ntumbero mu vyo uzokora vyose. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />None si jewe ndakwibaririye nti: Komera ushire ubwoba? Ntutinye, ntucike intege, kuko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe nzojana nawe aho uzoja hose.”<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Nuko Yosuwa aca ategeka abatware b’Abisirayeli ati: <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />“Nimunyurangane muce mu mihana, mubwire abantu muti: ‘Nimutegure ivyo muzofungura mu rugendo. Kuko mu misi itatu tuzojabuka uruzi Yorodani, kugira ngo twinjire igihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye ngo mucegukire.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Ariko Yosuwa abarira abo mu miryango ya Reyubeni na Gadi hamwe n’igice c’umuryango wa Manase ati: <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />“Mwibuke itegeko Mose umusavyi w’Imana yabahaye. Yababwiye ati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abahaye akaruhuko, abahaye iki gihugu.’ <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Abagore banyu, abana banyu n’ibitungwa vyanyu birashobora gusigara muri iki gihugu Mose yabahaye co mu buseruko bwa Yorodani, ariko abagabo bashobora kuja mu ntambara bafate ibigwanisho, bajabuke imbere ya benewabo. Mutegerezwa kubafasha, <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />gushika <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abahaye uburuhukiro nk’uko namwe yabubahaye, bagafata igihugu cose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye. Inyuma y’aho, muzoheza mugaruke mube mu gihugu canyu, ico Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabahaye mu buseruko bwa Yorodani, uravye iyo izuba riserukira.”<verse eid="JOS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Maze bishura Yosuwa bati: “Ivyo udutegeka vyose tuzobikora, kandi aho uzoturungika hose tuzojayo. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Nk’uko twumvira Mose, ni ko na wewe tuzokwumvira. Ariko rero, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe azobane nawe nk’uko yabana na Mose. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Uwuzogarariza amategeko yawe ntakore ivyo uvuze azokwicwa. Ariko ukomere ushire ubwoba!”<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Rahabu anyegeza abatasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />Maze Yosuwa mwene Nuni arungika abatasi babiri mu mpisho, bava i Shitimu aho Abisirayeli bari bashinze amahema. Abawira ati: “Genda murondere amakuru y’ingene ico gihugu kimeze, na canecane i Yeriko.” Nuko baragenda binjira mu nzu kwa maraya yitwa Rahabu, basabaho indaro.<verse eid="JOS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Ariko umwami w’i Yeriko aca aramenya ko hariho abantu b’Abisirayeli baje muri iryo joro gutata ico gihugu. <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Aca arungika intumwa kuri Rahabu ati: “Zana abo bantu baje aho mu nzu iwawe, kuko baje gutata igihugu cacu cose.”<verse eid="JOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4" />Ariko Rahabu yari yabanyegeje. Aca ababwira ati: “Ni vyo abo bantu baje iwanje, ariko sinamenye iyo baje bava. <verse eid="JOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5" />Ku mugoroba, hageze kwugara amarembo y’igisagara, baciye bagenda, kandi sinzi inzira bajanye. Ihute mubakurikire, kumbure mwobafata.” <verse eid="JOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6" />Ariko yari yabanyegeje hejuru ku nzu, abapfuka ibiti bivamwo inyuzi yari yahanikiye. <verse eid="JOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Ba bantu baca bafata ibarabara rija ku ruzi Yorodani ngo baje kubaronderayo. Bamaze gusohoka, irembo rica rirugarwa.<verse eid="JOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Mw’ijoro, imbere y’uko abo batasi baryama, Rahabu aduga hejuru ku nzu aho bari <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" />ababwira ati: “Ndazi ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabahaye iki gihugu, kandi ubwoba bwadutekeye, abantu bose imitima yabo yarandutse kubera ubwoba mwaduteye. <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" />Twarumvise ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakamije Ikiyaga Gitukura ku bwanyu igihe mwariko murava muri Egiputa, turumva n’ivyo mwagiriye Sihoni na Ogi, abami babiri b’Abamori, bo mu buseruko bwa Yorodani, abo mwaranduye rwose. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Tuvyumvise, imitima yacu yacitse ivutu kubera ubwoba, kandi umuntu wese aca arihebura kubera mwebwe, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari we Mana iganje hejuru mw’ijuru no hasi, kw’isi.<verse eid="JOS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" />None rero, nimundahire mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ko muzogirira neza umuryango wanje, kuko ndabagiriye neza. Mumpe ikimenyetso c’ukuri <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />ko muzokingira ubuzima bwa data n’ubwa mama, n’ubw’abo tuvukana hamwe n’ivyanje vyose, ko muzotuzigama ntidupfe.”<verse eid="JOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Ba batasi baramusezeranira bati: “Tukurahiye ubuzima bwacu nyene! Nutavuga ivyo turiko turakora hano, natwe tuzoba abizigirwa kandi tuzokugirira neza, igihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba aduhaye iki gihugu.”<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Nuko, aca abururutsa ku mugozi abacishije mw’idirisha, kuko inzu yiwe yari ifatanye n’uruhome rugize uruzitiro rw’igisagara. <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Aca ababwira ati: “Nimugende, muce mu mitumba kugira ngo ababakurikiye ntibababone. Mwinyegezeyo imisi itatu gushika bagarutse, muzoheze mubandanye urugendo rwanyu.”<verse eid="JOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Abo bagabo na bo baramubwira bati: “Indahiro twakurahiye ntizodukurikirana <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />nitwinjira muri iki gihugu, ntidusange aka kanyuzi gatukura kw’idirisha watwururukirijeko canke nitutasanga wegeranirije umuryango wawe wose muri iyi nzu: so na nyoko, abo muvukana n’umuryango wawe wose. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Nihagira uwusohoka akava mu nzu yawe, akaja mw’ibarabara, amaraso yiwe ntazoja ku mitwe yacu, si twebwe tuzoyabazwa. Ariko hagize uwugira ico aba ari mu nzu yawe, amaraso yiwe azoduharurweko. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Kandi niwaramuka uvuze ivyo turiko turakora, indahiro waturahije ntizodufata.”<verse eid="JOS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Rahabu na we arabishura ati: “Bibe nk’uko mubivuze.” Nuko, arabarungika bafata akayira. Aca afata ka kanyuzi gatukura, akabohera kw’idirisha.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Ba batasi baca bafata inzira ija mu mitumba bamarayo imisi itatu gushika aho bamwe bariko barabakurikira bagarutse, babarondeye hose bakababura. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Ba batasi babiri baca baramanuka bava mu mitumba, bajabuka Yorodani, maze bashitse biganira Yosuwa mwene Nuni ivyabashikiye. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />Bamubwira bati: “Ni ukuri <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaduhaye kirya gihugu. Abantu baho bose barihebuye kubera kudutinya.”<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Uko bajabutse Yorodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />Hakiri kare mu gitondo, Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli barahaguruka bava i Shitimu baja kuri Yorodani, bashingaho amahema imbere yo kujabuka. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />Haheze imisi itatu, abatware banyuragira muri mahema babamwo, <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" />babwira abantu bati: “Nimwabona Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mukabona n’abaherezi ari bo Balewi bayireruye, bagiye, namwe muce muva aho muri muyikurikire. <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />Kubera iyi nzira mutari bwayicemwo, bazobarongora, babaje imbere. Ariko mugendere nko ku ngero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi bibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 900.</char></note> inyuma yabo, ntimuze muyegere.”<verse eid="JOS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Yosuwa abarira abantu ati: “Mwiyeze kuko ejo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokora ibitangaza bikomeye muri mwebwe.”<verse eid="JOS 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Yosuwa yongera abarira abaherezi ati: “Fata Isandugu y’Isezerano muje imbere y’abandi mu kujabuka.” Nuko baterura iyo Sandugu, baja imbere baragenda.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yosuwa ati: “Uyu musi ngira ntangure kugushira hejuru imbere y’Abisirayeli, kugira ngo bamenye ko ndi kumwe nawe nk’uko nari kumwe na Mose. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />Barira abaherezi bareruye Isandugu y’Isezerano uti: ‘Nimwashika ku nkengera y’uruzi Yorodani, muce murutambukiramwo muruhagararemwo.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Yosuwa abwira Abisirayeli ati: “Egera hino mwumvirize amajambo y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />Iki ni co kizobamenyesha ko Imana nzima iri muri mwebwe, kandi ko izokwirukana imbere yanyu Abanyakanani, Abaheti, Abahiwi, Abaperizi, Abagirugashi, Abamori n’Abayebusi. <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" />Raba Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nyene isi yose igiye kuri Yorodani imbere yanyu. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />None rero, nimutoranye abagabo icumi na babiri mu miryango y’Abisirayeli, umwumwe mu muryango. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" />Abaherezi bareruye Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nyene isi yose nibamara guhonyoza ibirenge muri Yorodani, ruzocikamwo kabiri, amazi ntasubire gutemba, ahagarare nk’uruhome.”<verse eid="JOS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Nuko abantu bose bamaze kuzinga amahema yabo kugira ngo bajabuke Yorodani, abaherezi baca barerura Isandugu y’Isezerano, babaja imbere. <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" />Ico gihe hari mu gihe c’iyimbura, kandi Yorodani rwari rwarengeye inkombe zarwo. Ariko ba baherezi bari bareruye Isandugu y’Isezerano bamaze guhonyoza ibirenge mu mazi yo ku nkengera y’urwo ruzi, <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />amazi yo haruguru aca arahagarara ntiyasubira gutemba. Yiyegeraniriza hamwe kure y’aho bari, mu gisagara ca Adamu, hafi y’i Zaretani, ayo hepfo na yo abandanya amanuka aja mu kiyaga ca Araba, ari co Kiyaga c’Umunyu gushika akamye. Nuko abantu baca barajabuka hakurya bashika ahegereye Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />Ico gihe abaherezi bari bareruye Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bari bahagaze bemye kw’isi yumye hagati muri Yorodani, Abisirayeli na bo bariko barajabuka gushika ihanga ryose rijabutse rica kw’isi yumutse.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />Abagize iryo hanga bose bahejeje kujabuka Yorodani, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yosuwa ati: <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />“Toranya abagabo icumi na babiri, umwumwe mu muryango, <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />ubabwire batore amabuye icumi n’abiri muri Yorodani aho abaherezi bari bahagaze, bagende bayajanye, baje kuyarunda aho muja kurara ijoro ry’uno musi.”<verse eid="JOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Nuko Yosuwa akoranya abagabo icumi na babiri bo mu Bisirayeli, umwe mu muryango, <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />ababwira ati: “Nimugende hagati muri Yorodani, imbere y’Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. Umwe wese atore ibuye, aritware ku rutugu. Mutware amabuye icumi n’abiri nk’uko imiryango ya Isirayeli ingana, <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" />tuzoyakoreshe mu kwubaka icibutso. Mu myaka iri imbere, abana banyu nibababaza bati: ‘Mbega aya mabuye asigura iki?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />muzobishure muti: Atwibutsa ko uruzi Yorodani rwigeze guhagarara igihe Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yariko irajabuka. Ayo mabuye ni ayo kubera icibutso ubwoko bw’Abisirayeli ibihe vyose.”<verse eid="JOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Nuko Abisirayeli babikora uko Yosuwa yabibategetse. Batora amabuye icumi n’abiri hagati muri Yorodani, nk’uko imiryango ya Isirayeli iri, kandi nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabibwiye Yosuwa. Batwara ayo mabuye aho baraye ijoro ryabo rya mbere, bahubaka icibutso. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Yosuwa na we ashinga ayandi mabuye icumi n’abiri hagati muri Yorodani aho ba baherezi bari bareruye Isandugu y’Isezerano bari bahagaze. Ayo mabuye aracari ngaho gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="JOS 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Abaherezi bari bareruye Isandugu bagumye bahagaze hagati muri Yorodani gushika ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse Yosuwa vyose bikozwe nk’uko Mose yari yarabibwiye Yosuwa. Maze abantu barihuta kujabuka <verse eid="JOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />kandi ubwo nyene bose bahejeje kujabuka bagashika hakurya, Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’abaherezi bayireruye na bo baca barajabuka abantu bose babitegereza. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" />Abo mu muryango wa Reyubeni n’uwa Gadi, n’igice kimwe c’uwa Manase na bo barajabuka, biteguriye intambara kandi bari imbere y’Abisirayeli bandi, nk’uko Mose yari yabibabwiye. <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />Abagabo bashika ibihumbi mirongo ine bafise ibigwanisho biteguriye intambara ni bo bajabutse baca imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> baja mu biyaya vya Yeriko kugwana.<verse eid="JOS 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />Uwo musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ashira Yosuwa hejuru imbere y’Abisirayeli, na bo baramwubaha imisi yiwe yose, nk’uko bubaha Mose.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yosuwa ati: <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />“Barira abaherezi bareruye Isandugu y’Isezerano bave muri Yorodani.”<verse eid="JOS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Nuko Yosuwa abwira abaherezi ati: “Nimuve muri Yorodani.”<verse eid="JOS 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />Ba baherezi bava muri Yorodani bareruye ya Sandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Ku musi ugira icumi w’ukwezi kwa mbere ni ho bajabuka Yorodani, bacumbika i Gilugali mu buseruko bwa Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Aho i Gilugali ni ho Yosuwa yashinze ya mabuye icumi n’abiri bakura muri Yorodani. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Yosuwa abarira Abisirayeli ati: “Mu bihe bizoza, abana banyu nibababaza bati: ‘Aya mabuye asigura iki?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />Muzobabwire muti: ‘Abisirayeli bajabutse Yorodani bagendera kw’isi yumutse.’ <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yakamije uruzi Yorodani muvyibonera, gushika muhejeje kujabuka. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakoreye kuri Yorodani ivyo yakoreye ku Kiyaga Gitukura, igihe yatuma amazi akama imbere yacu, gushika twese tujabutse. <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />Ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabikoze kugira ngo amahanga yose yo kw’isi aze amenye ububasha bw’ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kandi namwe mutinye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.”<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />Abami bose b’Abamori bo hakurya ya Yorodani, n’abami b’Abanyakanani bo ku nkengera ya Yorodani bumvise ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakamije Yorodani kugira ngo Abisirayeli bajabuke, bose bacika ivutu, mu mitima yabo barihebura kubera ubwoba, ntibaba bakigira intege zo guhangara Abisirayeli ngo babagwanye.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urunganwe rushasha rukebwa i Gilugali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Ico gihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yosuwa ati: “Rondera amabuye akarishe nk’imbugita, ukebe abagabo bose bo muri uru runganwe rwa kabiri rw’Abisirayeli.” <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Nuko Yosuwa ategura amabuye akarishe nk’imbugita, akebera Abisirayeli i Gibeyati Haraloti.<verse eid="JOS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4" />Iki ni co catumye Yosuwa abikora: Abari bavuye muri Egiputa bafise imyaka yo kuja mu ntambara bose bari bapfiriye mu bugaragwa bariko bava muri Egiputa. <verse eid="JOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5" />Abari bavuyeyo bose bari barakebwe, ariko abavukiye mu bugaragwa bari mu rugendo, bamaze kuva muri Egiputa, ntibari barakebwe. <verse eid="JOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6" />Abisirayeli bamaze imyaka mirongo ine bayerera mu bugaragwa, gushika aho abari bafise imyaka yo kuja mu ntambara igihe bava muri Egiputa bose bapfuye bagahera, kuko bari bagararije <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabarahiye ko batazobona igihugu yari yarasezeraniye ba sekuruza ko azokibaha, igihugu gitemba amata n’ubuki. <verse eid="JOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />Nuko ahagurutsa abana mu gishingo ca ba se, abo rero ni bo Yosuwa yakevye. Ntibari bwigere bakebwa kuko batakebewe ku nzira baja i Kanani. <verse eid="JOS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />N’uko abagabo bose bamaze gukebwa, baguma aho bari bashinze amahema gushika bose bakize.<verse eid="JOS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yosuwa ati: “Uyu musi ndabakuyeko ibimaramare vyose vyatewe n’ubuja bwo muri Egiputa.” Ico kibanza gica citwa Gilugali gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />Ku mugoroba wo ku musi ugira icumi na kane w’ukwo kwezi, bakiri ngaho i Gilugali mu biyaya vy’i Yeriko, Abisirayeli bahimbaza Pasika. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Ku musi wakurikiye Pasika, baca barya ivyokurya vyo muri ico gihugu, barya imikate itagira umwambiro n’ingano zikaranze. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />Maze uhereye ku musi wakurikiye uwo baririyeko ivyokurya vyo muri ico gihugu, manu ntiyasubiriye kuboneka. Abisirayeli ntibongeye gusubira kuronka manu; uwo mwaka bariye ivyo basoromye i Kanani.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ingene bafashe Yeriko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />Yosuwa yegereje i Yeriko, yunamura amaso abona umugabo ahagaze imbere yiwe afise inkota mu minwe. Yosuwa aramwegera, aramubaza ati: “Mbega uri ku ruhande rwacu canke ku ruhande rw’abansi bacu?”<verse eid="JOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />Na we aramwishura ati: “Sindi ku ruhande na rumwe. Ndi umugabisha w’ingabo z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” Nuko Yosuwa aca arunama, yikubita hasi, amuha icubahiro, hanyuma aramubaza ati: “None ushaka ko jewe umusavyi wawe nkora iki?”<verse eid="JOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />Wa mugabisha w’ingabo z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Ambura ibirato vyawe, kuko aha hantu uhagaze ari ahera.” Nuko Yosuwa yambura ibirato vyiwe.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Kandi ico gihe, igisagara c’i Yeriko cari cugawe bikomeye kubera gutinya Abisirayeli. Nta muntu yasohoka canke ngo yinjire.<verse eid="JOS 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yosuwa ati: “Ehe raba nshize Yeriko mu maboko yanyu, hamwe n’umwami waho n’abasoda baho bahambaye. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Mwe n’ingabo zawe nimuzunguruke igisagara rimwe gusa ku musi, muzobikore imisi itandatu. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />Muzojane n’abaherezi indwi bitwaje inzamba zikozwe mu mahembe y’intama, bagendere imbere y’Isandugu. Ku musi ugira indwi, muzozunguruke ico gisagara incuro indwi, abo baherezi bariko baravuza izo nzamba. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Nimwumva abaherezi bavugije inzamba n’ijwi rirengera, abasoda bose bazoce na bo bashira ijwi hejuru basemerere cane, inzitiro z’igisagara zizoca zisenyuka, abantu bose bazoce binjira, umwe wese yinjirire aho azoba atumbereye.”<verse eid="JOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Nuko Yosuwa mwene Nuni aca akoranya abaherezi, ababwira ati: “Nimurerure Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, abaherezi indwi bo muri mwebwe batware inzamba bagendere imbere yayo.” <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Aca ategeka abasoda ati: “Genda! Nimuzunguruke igisagara, kandi habeho ingabo zigendera imbere y’Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Yosuwa ahejeje kubwira abantu ivyo, ba baherezi indwi bitwaje inzamba baca bagendera imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bavuza za nzamba. Ya Sandugu y’Isezerano na yo irabakurikira. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Abasoda bafise ibigwanisho na bo baja imbere ya ba baherezi bitwaje inzamba, abandi bakurikira isandugu, kandi abaherezi bagenda baravuza inzamba. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Ariko Yosuwa yari yababwiye ati: “Ntimuze muvuze akaruru k’intambara, ntimuze muvuze urwamo, ndetse ntihaze hagire ijambo na rimwe muvuga, gushika umusi nzobabwira, ico gihe ni ho muzokoma akaruru.” <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Nuko batwara Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bazunguruka ico gisagara rimwe gusa, bahejeje abantu baca basubira mu mahema yabo, bararaho.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Bukeye Yosuwa avyuka kare mu gitondo, ba baherezi na bo barerura ya Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" />Abo baherezi indwi bitwaje inzamba baja imbere, bagendera imbere y’Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bavuza inzamba. Abasoda bafise ibigwanisho bakurikira Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, inzamba na zo ziriko ziravuzwa. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />Ku musi ugira kabiri bazungurutse ico gisagara incuro imwe, baca basubira mu mahema yabo. Bamara imisi itandatu babigira gutyo.<verse eid="JOS 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />Ku musi ugira indwi bavyuka hakiri kare cane, bazunguruka ico gisagara nk’uko bahora babigira, mugabo uwo musi bakizunguruka incuro indwi. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />Ku ncuro igira indwi, abaherezi bavugije inzamba, Yosuwa aca abwira abantu ati: “Koma akaruru, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abahaye kino gisagara! <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Igisagara n’ibikirimwo vyose bibe ishikanwa k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ariko muzigame maraya Rahabu n’abo mu nzu yiwe, kuko yakingiye abatasi bacu. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Ntihagire ikintu na kimwe mu vyagenewe guturirwa mwisigariza, kuko mwoba mwikwegeye kuranduka, kandi mwoba mukwegeye ingorane n’umuvumo Abisirayeli mu mahema yabo. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Amafeza, inzahabu, n’ibikozwe mu mwakaka no mu vyuma, bibe ivyejejwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bijanwe mu kigega ciwe.”<verse eid="JOS 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />Inzamba ivuze, abantu baca bakoma akaruru n’inkomezi zabo zose. Ubwo nyene inzitiro z’i Yeriko zica zirasenyagurika, umusoda wese aca yinjirana aho yari atumbereye, bafata ico gisagara, <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />batikiza ivyo muri ico gisagara vyose, baranduza inkota abakibamwo bose: abagabo, abagore, abana, abatama, inka, intama n’indogoba.<verse eid="JOS 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Yosuwa abarira ba bagabo babiri baja gutata ico gisagara ati: “Nimuje ku nzu ya maraya, muzane abari muri yo bose nk’uko mwabimurahiye.” <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" />Ba bagabo bari bagiye gutata ico gisagara baca binjira kwa Rahabu, baramusohokana; we na se, na nyina, abo bavukana hamwe n’abari muri iyo nzu bose. Basohokana umuryango wose, babashira hafi y’aho Abisirayeli bari bashinze amahema yabo.<verse eid="JOS 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Baca baturira igisagara cose, n’ivyari muri co, ariko inzahabu, ifeza, ibikozwe mu mwakaka no mu vyuma, babitwara mu bubiko bwo mu nzu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JOS 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" />Maze Yosuwa arokora ubuzima bwa maraya Rahabu n’umuryango wiwe wose n’ivyo yari afise vyose, kuko yanyegeje abatasi Yosuwa yarungitse i Yeriko. Gushika n’ubu aracaba mu Bisirayeli.<verse eid="JOS 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />Uwo mwanya Yosuwa ashira umuvumo kuri ico gisagara ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 6:26">“Haravumwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> umuntu azosubira kwubaka iki gisagara Yeriko.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 6:26">Amatanguriro yaco niyayashiraho azobure umwana wiwe w’imfura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 6:26">kandi ageze gushiraho inzugi z’irembo azobure umuhererezi.”<verse eid="JOS 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />Uko ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabanye na Yosuwa, na we amenyekana mu gihugu cose.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s1">Icaha ca Akani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />Ariko Abisirayeli barenga ku vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yababujije ku bijanye n’ivyo yagize inyegu yiwe. Umugabo yitwa Akani mwene Karumi, Karumi mwene Zabudi, Zabudi mwene Zera, Zera wo mu muryango wa Yuda, yiba bimwe muri vyo. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca araraka kubw’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="JOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Yosuwa arungika abantu bari bavuye i Yeriko ngo baje gutera i Hayi, igisagara kiri hafi y’i Beti-Aveni, mu buseruko bwa Beteli, ababwira ati: “Nimugende mutate iriya ntara.” Nuko baragenda batata Hayi.<verse eid="JOS 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />Bagarutse babarira Yosuwa bati: “Ntibikenewe ko urinda kurungika abantu bose i Hayi. Rungika abantu ibihumbi bibiri canke bitatu baje kuhafata, ntiwirirwe uragora ingabo zose kuko abakibamwo ari bake cane.” <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Nuko abantu nk’ibihumbi bitatu baragenda, ariko abantu b’i Hayi barabirukana, <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />babicamwo abantu mirongo itatu na batandatu, barabirukana kuva ku marembo y’igisagara bashika ku mitumba y’ibitandara, bagenda barabica bamanuka. Abisirayeli babibonye bicwa n’ubwoba, imitima yabo icika ivutu.<verse eid="JOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Maze Yosuwa yitabagurirako impuzu, yubama hasi imbere y’Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yirirwaho rirarenga. Abatware b’Abisirayeli na bo nyene babigenza batyo, bisiga n’imikungugu ku mitwe. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Yosuwa aravuga ati: “Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, Ni iki catumye utujabukana Yorodani ukatuzana muri iki gihugu kugira ngo Abamori bakitwiciremwo? Ese iyo twigumira hakurya ya Yorodani? <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />Mbega Mwami mvuge iki ko Abisirayeli birukanywe n’abansi babo? <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />Abanyakanani n’abandi banyamahanga nibavyumva bazodukikuza bahanagure amazina yacu kw’isi. None izina ryawe rihambaye uzorigwanira ute?”<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yishura Yosuwa ati: “Haguruka! Ni kubera iki wubamye hasi gutyo? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Isirayeli yacumuye. Yarenze kw’isezerano ryanje, iryo nabategetse kwubahiriza. Basahuye ivyari kuba inyegu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ntibivye gusa ahubwo baranabeshe, babinyegeza mu vyabo. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />Ni co gituma Abisirayeli batashoboye guhagarara imbere y’abansi babo. Babahaye umugongo barabahunga kuko bikwegeye ugutikizwa. Sinzobana namwe kiretse mukuye muri mwebwe icagenewe kurandurwa cose.”<verse eid="JOS 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />Genda ubwire abantu biyeze. Ubabwire uti: “Nimwiyeze kubera umusi w’ejo, kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana y’Abisirayeli avuze: Ivyari vyagenewe kuba inyegu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> biri muri mwebwe, yemwe Bisirayeli. Ntimuzigera mushobora kunesha abansi banyu gushika mubikuye muri mwebwe.<verse eid="JOS 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />Ejo mu gitondo muzokorane uko imiryango yanyu iri, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokwerekana umuryango uwakoze ivyo avukamwo. Abo muri uwo muryango bazoce bakorana, maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokwerekana inzu uwo muntu akomokamwo. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Uwuzofatanwa ivyari kuba inyegu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoranduzwe umuriro, aturiranwe n’ivyiwe vyose, kuko yarenze isezerano agakora ikizira mu Bisirayeli.”<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Bukeye, hakiri kare mu gatondo, Yosuwa akoranya imiryango y’Abisirayeli, uwa Yuda uba ari wo ufatwa. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />Mu bwoko bwa Yuda hafatwa Abakomoka kuri Zera. Abakomoka kuri Zera bakoranye hafatwa abo mu muryango wa Zabudi. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />Yosuwa ahamagaza umugabo ku mugabo, hanyuma hafatwa Akani mwene Karumi, Karumi mwene Zabudi, Zabudi mwene Zera, Zera wo mu muryango wa Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Yosuwa abwira Akani ati: “Mwana wanje, nuhe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> icubahiro, Imana ya Isirayeli, uyishire hejuru. Mbwira ico wakoze kandi ntumpishe.”<verse eid="JOS 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Akani yishura Yosuwa ati: “Ni ivy’ukuri naracumuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />Mu vyo twari twanyaze nabonyemwo ikanzu nziza iva i Babiloni, na shekeli amajana abiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 2,3.</char></note> z’ifeza, mbona n’ikigegene c’inzahabu gipima shekeli mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 575.</char></note> nca ndavyipfuza. Nabizitse mu kuzimu mw’ihema ryanje, ifeza ni zo ziri musi y’ivyo vyose.”<verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Nuko Yosuwa arungika intumwa, zisanga ni ho binyegejwe nk’uko Akani yabivuze, na za feza ziri musi y’ibindi. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />Baca babikurayo babizanira Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli bose, na bo babisanza imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JOS 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Maze Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli bose bafata Akani mwene Zera, bafata za feza, ya kanzu, za nzahabu, abahungu biwe n’abakobwa biwe, inka, indogoba n’intama ziwe, ihema ryiwe, babajana mu kiyaya ca Akori. <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Yosuwa amubwira ati: “Ni iki catumye udukwegera aya magorwa? Uyu musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arayaguteye nawe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 7:25">Maze Abisirayeli bose baca bamwicisha amabuye, bamwicana n’umuryango wiwe wose, ibiziga vyabo baca barabiturira. <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />Akani baca bamurundako ikirundo kinini c’amabuye, kandi kiracariho gushika n’ubu. Ni co gituma ico kiyaya baciye bacita Akabande ka Akori [bisigura akabande k’ivyago] kandi ni ko kacitwa gushika n’ubu. Maze uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buca burahwama. Gushika n’uno musi aho hantu hitwa Akabande ka Akori.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s1">Abisirayeli batsinda Hayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yosuwa ati: “Ntutinye, ntucike intege. Hitana ingabo zawe zose muduge gutera Hayi. Kuko namaze kuguha intsinzi ku mwami w’i Hayi, ku bantu biwe, ku gisagara ciwe no ku gihugu ciwe. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />Mugirire Hayi nk’ivyo mwagiriye Yeriko n’umwami waho, kiretse ko ivyo muzonyaga muzovyitwarira bikaba ivyanyu. Mubatege umutego bave mu gisagara.”<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Nuko Yosuwa n’ingabo ziwe zose baja gutera i Hayi. Atoranya abasoda ibihumbi mirongo itatu mu banyentambara bakomeye abarungika mw’ijoro <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />abaha amategeko ati: “Nyumviriza neza! Mugende mubatege umutego baze inyuma y’igisagara. Ntimukije kure, kandi mwese mugume mugavye. <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />Jewe n’abo turi kumwe tuzokwegera igisagara, maze abaho nibaza kutugwanya nka kumwe kwa mbere, tuzokwigira nk’ababahunga. <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />Bazoca badukurikira gushika tubashikane kure y’igisagara, bibaza bati: ‘Baraduhunze nk’uko baduhunze ubwa mbere.’ <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />Mu gihe tuzoba turiko turabahunga, namwe muzoce muva aho mwinyegeje mufate ico gisagara. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu araja kukibaha mu maboko yanyu. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Nimwamara kugifata, muce mugiturira. Mukore ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse. Ayo ni yo mategeko ndabahaye.”<verse eid="JOS 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Nuko Yosuwa aca arabarungika, baca baja mu bibanza vyo kwinyegezamwo, babunda hagati ya Beteli na Hayi, amaja mu burengero bwa Hayi, ariko iryo joro Yosuwa iryo joro ararana n’abandi aho bari bashinze amahema.<verse eid="JOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Mu gitondo hatarabona neza Yosuwa avyura ingabo ziwe n’abatware b’Abisirayeli, bagenda bagana Hayi, agendera imbere yabo. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />Ingabo zose zari zajanye na we ziragenda zishika imbere y’igisagara. Baca bashinga amahema mu buraruko bwa Hayi, hasigara ikiyaya hagati yabo n’ico gisagara. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Yosuwa yari kumwe n’abasoda bashika ibihumbi bitanu, abo binyegeza hagati ya Beteli n’i Hayi mu ruhande rwo mu burengero bw’ico gisagara. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Abasoda bagenerwa ibibanza baba barabamwo; ikibanza nyamukuru gishingwa mu buraruko bw’igisagara, abandi bashinga amahema mu burengero bwaco. Iryo joro, Yosuwa wewe arara mu kiyaya.<verse eid="JOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Umwami w’i Hayi abonye Abisirayeli mu kiyaya, aca akoranya ingabo ziwe zose zihutira kuja kubatera kare mu gitondo ngo babasange aharabana n’ikiyaya Araba. Ariko ntibari bazi ko hariho ababibundiye inyuma y’igisagara. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli barabareka barabakurikira, baca biruka babakwegera mu bugaragwa. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Abagabo bose b’i Hayi bahamagarirwa kubirukako, gutyo mu gukurikira Yosuwa baba bagiye kure y’igisagara cabo. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Nta mugabo n’umwe yasigaye i Hayi canke i Beteli adakurikiye Abisirayeli. Basiga igisagara cuguruye barabakurikira.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca abarira Yosuwa ati: “Ramvura ukuboko kwawe uduze icumu ryawe uritumbereje kuri Hayi, kuko ntanze ico gisagara mu maboko yawe.” Nuko Yosuwa aca atumbereza icumu riri mu ntoke ziwe ico gisagara. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />Yosuwa amaze gutanga ico kimenyetso, abari babunze inyuma y’igisagara baca barahaguruka, bava aho bari babunze biruka baja mu gisagara, baragifata, ubwo nyene baca baragiturira.<verse eid="JOS 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />Abagabo b’i Hayi bahindukiye inyuma, babona umwotsi uva mu gisagara upfunduka uduga hejuru, ariko ntibari bagifise akaryo ko guhunga, kuko Abisirayeli bari bahungiye mu bugaragwa baciye babahindukirira. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli babonye ivyo bateguye kuri ico gisagara bikunze, bakabona n’umwotsi upfunduka uva muri ico gisagara, baca barahindukira batera abantu b’i Hayi. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Bamwe bari babibundiye na bo nyene baca bava mu gisagara barabatera, babata hagati, Abisirayeli babakikuza impande zose. Isirayeli irabatikiza, ntihagira n’uwusigara canke ngo abatoroke. <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />Ariko umwami w’i Hayi baramuretse, bamuzanira Yosuwa ari muzima.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Abisirayeli bamaze kwica Ab’i Hayi bose babatsinda mu mitumba no mu biyaya iyo bari bahungiye, bose bamaze kwicishwa inkota, baciye baja i Hayi kwica abari basigayeyo bose. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Abagabo n’abagore ibihumbi cumi na bibiri ni bo bishwe uwo musi; kandi ni bo baba i Hayi. <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />Kuko Yosuwa yari yagumye adugije icumu ryiwe gushika ababa i Hayi bose baranduwe. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />Abisirayeli basahura ibintu vyo muri ico gisagara, barabitwara nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabibariye Yosuwa.<verse eid="JOS 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Nuko Yosuwa aturira Hayi hasigara ari ikirundo c’ivyasambutse gusa, hasigara ari igisanze gushika n’ubu. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />Maze Yosuwa amanika umwami w’i Hayi ku giti, agumaho gushika ku mugoroba. Izuba rirenze, Yosuwa abwira abantu ngo bamanure ikiziga ciwe, ngo bagiterere imbere y’irembo ry’igisagara. Baca bakirundako ikirundo c’amabuye kinini cane, kandi kiracariho gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bongera kunagura isezerano ku musozi Ebalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />Nuko Yosuwa aca yubakira igicaniro <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli, hafi y’umusozi Ebalu, <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" />nk’uko Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabitegetse Abisirayeli. Yacubatse akurikije uko vyanditswe mu Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe vya Mose, acubaka mu mabuye atabaje, ata cuma cigeze kiyakorako. Kuri co, ahashikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikimazi c’ishimwe n’ibimazi vyo guturirwa. <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />Bari ngaho nyene, Yosuwa yandika kuri ayo mabuye Ivyagezwe vya Mose, Abisirayeli bose barorera. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" />Abisirayeli bose, bari kumwe n’abakuru babo, abatware n’abacamanza, bose bari bahagaze; bamwe ku ruhande rumwe abandi ku rundi rw’Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> baraba abaherezi b’Abalewi bayireruye. Bose abanyamahanga baba mu Bisirayeli, n’abasangwa bose bari ngaho. Igice kimwe c’abantu bari bahagaze imbere y’umusozi Gerizimu, ikindi cari gihagaze imbere y’umusozi Ebalu, nk’uko Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabitegetse igihe yatanga inyigisho z’ingene bazohora bahezagira abantu ba Isirayeli.<verse eid="JOS 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Yosuwa asoma amajambo yose yanditswe mu gitabu c’ivyagezwe, asoma imigisha n’imivumo yose nk’uko yanditswe muri ico gitabu c’ivyagezwe. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Nta jambo na rimwe Mose yategetse Yosuwa atasomeye ishengero ryose ry’Abisirayeli, harimwo n’abagore n’abana, n’abanyamahanga baba muri bo.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ab’i Gibiyoni bahenda Abisirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />Nuko inkuru y’ivyabaye ishikira abami bose bo mu burengero bwa Yorodani, mu karere k’imisozi miremire, mu biyaya no ku nkengera z’Ikiyaga Mediterane, gushika i Libani: abami b’Abaheti, ab’Abamori, ab’Abanyakanani, ab’Abaperizi, ab’Abahiwi hamwe n’ab’Abayebusi. <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" />Bose baca barakorana kugira ngo batere Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />Ariko abantu b’i Gibeyoni bumvise ivyo Yosuwa yakoreye Yeriko na Hayi, <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />baca bakoresha urwenge, barungikira intumwa Yosuwa, bazirungika ku ndogoba bashasheko imifuko yatabaguritse, babaha n’imikuza y’imishire imenaguritse. <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />Bambara ibirato bishaje kandi biteye ibiremo, n’impuzu zitabaguritse. Imikate batwaye yose yari yumye, iyindi yaraguye ifira. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Maze baja iyo Yosuwa ari mu mahema i Gilugali, bamubwira ari kumwe n’abandi Bisirayeli bati: “Tuje tuva mu gihugu ca kure cane, tuje gusaba ngo tugiriranire amasezerano y’amahoro.”<verse eid="JOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" />Abisirayeli babwira abo Bahiwi bati: “Mbega twobwirwa n’iki ko mutari abo ngaha hafi yacu? Kuko nimba muri aba hafi, nta masezerano y’amahoro tugiriranira.”<verse eid="JOS 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Bishura Yosuwa bati: “Turi abasavyi bawe.” Yosuwa arababaza ati: “Muri ba nde? Muje muva he?”<verse eid="JOS 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />Baramwishura bati: “Twebwe abasavyi banyu twaje tuva mu gihugu ca kure, kuko twumvise ingene <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ahambaye, twumva n’ivyo yakoreye Egiputa. <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />Twarumvise kandi ivyo yakoreye abami babiri b’Abamori hakurya ya Yorodani, ari bo Sihoni umwami w’i Heshiboni na Ogi umwami w’i Bashani yaba i Ashitaroti. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />None abakuru bacu n’ababa mu gihugu cacu bose batubwiye bati: Nimutekere ivyo muzorira mu rugendo, mugende mubashikire mubabwire muti: Turi abasavyi banyu, nimuze tugiriranire isezerano ry’amahoro. <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Iyi mikate yari ishushe igihe twayitekera tuva i muhira. Ariko raba yarumye, yaramaze no kugwa ifira. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />N’iyi mikuza yari yuzuye igihe twaza ariko ubu raba ingene imaze kumenagurika. Impuzu n’ibirato vyacu vyahereye ku nzira.”<verse eid="JOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Maze Abisirayeli baca batangura gusuzuma ivyo bifungurwa baje bararira mu rugendo badasiguje <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Yosuwa aca abasezeranira isezerano ry’amahoro, abarongozi b’iryo hanga na bo nyene babishigikiza indahiro.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Haciye imisi itatu bagiriraniye iryo sezerano, Abisirayeli baca bumva ko Ab’i Gibiyoni ari ababanyi babo, ko babana hafi. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Abisirayeli baca bafata urugendo, mu misi itatu bashikira ibisagara vyabo: Gibeyoni, Kefira, Beroti hamwe na Kiriyati-Yeyarimu. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Ariko Abisirayeli ntibabaye bakibatera, kuko abarongozi b’ihanga ryabo bari babarahiye mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 9:18">Maze ikoraniro ryose ryidodombera abarongozi, <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />ariko abarongozi bababwira bati: “Twabarahiye mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli none ubu ntidushobora kubakorako. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />Iki ni co tuzobakorera: Tuzobareka babeho, kugira ngo uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntibudutikize kuko twoba turenze indahiro twabarahiye.” <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Barabandanya bati: “Reka babeho mugabo bazobe abo kudusaturira inkwi no kuvomera amazi ihanga ryacu.” Maze isezerano ry’abarongozi rica rirubahirizwa.<verse eid="JOS 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Yosuwa akoranya Ab’i Gibiyoni, ababwira ati: “Ni iki catumye muduhenda muti: ‘Turi abantu ba kure cane,’ kandi muba hafi yacu? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />Muri musi y’umuvumo: Ntimuzigera na rimwe muva ku gikorwa co gusatura inkwi no kuvomera amazi inzu y’Imana yanje.”<verse eid="JOS 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />Na bo bishura Yosuwa bati: “Twebwe abasavyi bawe twabwiwe neza ingene <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yari yategetse umusavyi wayo Mose ngo abahe iki gihugu cose ngo murandure abakibamwo bose. Natwe twaciye dutinya ko mwoturandura, ni co catumye dukora dutyo. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />None rero turi mu biganza vyanyu, nimutugire uko mubona bibereye.”<verse eid="JOS 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Nuko Yosuwa abakiza amaboko y’Abisirayeli, ntibabica. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Kuva uwo musi aca abagira abashenyi b’inkwi n’abavomyi b’amazi y’Abisirayeli, n’abajejwe kurondera ibikenewe vyose vy’igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu kibanza azohitamwo. Kandi ivyo baracabikora kugeza n’ubu.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s1">Izuba rihagarara hejuru y’ikiyaya c’i Gibeyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Ico gihe Adoni-Zedeki umwami w’i Yerusalemu yumva ko Yosuwa yafashe Hayi akahasambura rwose, akahagirira nk’uko yagiriye Yeriko n’umwami waho, yumva kandi ko abantu b’i Gibeyoni bagiriraniye isezerano ry’amahoro na Isirayeli, kandi ko bifatanije na bo. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />We n’abantu biwe baca bahagarika imitima kubera ivyo, kuko Gibeyoni cari igisagara gikomeye cangana na kimwe mu bisagara vy’abami, casumba Hayi mu bunini, kandi abantu baho bari abagwanyi bakomeye. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Nuko Adoni-Zedeki umwami w’i Yerusalemu atumako Hohamu umwami w’i Heburoni, Piramu umwami w’i Yarimuti, Yafiya umwami w’i Lakishi, hamwe na Debiri umwami wa Eguloni. <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />Ababwira ati: “Nimuze mumfashe gutera ab’i Gibeyoni, kuko bagiranye isezerano ry’amahoro na Yosuwa hamwe n’Abisirayeli.”<verse eid="JOS 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />Nuko abo bami b’Abamori uko ari batanu; uw’i Yerusalemu, uw’i Heburoni, uw’i Yarimuti, uw’i Lakishi hamwe n’uw’i Eguloni, bakoraniriza ingabo zabo hamwe, baraduga baja gutera i Gibeyoni.<verse eid="JOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Ab’i Gibeyoni na bo baca barungikira intumwa Yosuwa aho yari mu mahema i Gilugali, bamubwira bati: “Ntuhebe abasavyi bawe! Duga vuba udutabare! Ngwino udufashe kuko abami b’Abamori bo mu mitumba miremire bakoranye ngo badutere.”<verse eid="JOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Nuko Yosuwa aca afata urugendo ava i Gilugali ari kumwe n’abasoda biwe bose, hamwe n’abahizi biwe mu kugwana, baja i Gibeyoni. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yosuwa ati: “Ntubatinye, bose nabatanze mu maboko yawe. Nta n’umwe azoshobora kuguhagarara imbere.”<verse eid="JOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Bamaze ijoro ryose bagenda bava i Gilugali, Yosuwa arabahwikira. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abateza gucika ivutu imbere y’Abisirayeli, baronka intsinzi y’agahebuza, i Gibeyoni. Abisirayeli barabakurikira mw’ibarabara riduga i Beti-Horoni, babica ingenda kugeza bashitse i Azeka n’i Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />Bakiriko barahunga Abisirayeli bamanuka ibarabara riva i Beti-Horoni rija muri Azeka, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atibagura urubura rumeze nk’amabuye, abishwe n’urwo rubura basumba abishwe n’inkota y’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Uwo musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aha Abisirayeli intsinzi ku Bamori, Yosuwa asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari imbere y’Abisirayeli ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 10:12">“Ewe zuba, hagarara ugume hejuru ya Gibeyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:12">kandi nawe kwezi, ugume wakira hejuru y’ikiyaya ca Ayaloni.”<verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Izuba rirahagarara ritikakaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:13">n’ukwezi kuguma aho kwari kuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:13">gushika abagize iryo hanga bihoye abansi babo,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JOS 10:13">nk’uko vyanditswe mu gitabu ca Yashari.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 10:13">Izuba ryagumye rihagaze hagati mu kirere, ntiryarenga, hafi umusi wose. <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />Nta musi wigeze kubaho umeze nk’uwo kuva isi ibaho canke mu nyuma, aho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yishura umwana w’umuntu gutyo. Mu vy’ukuri uwo musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we yagwanira Isirayeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Maze Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli basubira mu mahema yabo i Gilugali.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosuwa yica abami batanu b’Abamori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Abo bami batanu bari bahunze binyegeza mu kinogo kirekire kiri musi y’ikibuye kinini i Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Yosuwa yumvise ko hari ababonye abo bami ko binyegeje muri ico kinogo i Makeda, <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />aca avuga ati: “Tembagariza ibibuye bininibinini mu rwinjiriro rw’ico kinogo, mushireho n’abantu bahacunge. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Ariko ntimuhagarare, mubandanye mukurikira abansi banyu, mubatere mubaciye inyuma, kandi mubabuze gushika mu bisagara vyabo, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabashize mu maboko yanyu.”<verse eid="JOS 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Nuko Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli barabica barabamara, ariko bakeya bo muri bo barashobora guhunga no gushikira ibisagara vyabo bizitiye cane. <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />Abasoda bose batabaruka impore, bashikira Yosuwa mu nsago z’i Makeda. Kuva ico gihe nta n’umwe yasubiriye kwubahuka kugira ico avuga kibi ku Bisirayeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Yosuwa aravuga ati: “Ugurura ico kinogo musohore abo bami batanu mubanzanire.” <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Nuko bazana abo bami bose uko ari batanu: uw’i Yerusalemu, uw’i Heburoni, uw’i Yarimuti, uw’i Lakishi, n’uw’i Eguloni. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />Abo bami babazaniye Yosuwa, aca ahamagaza abagabo bose b’Abisirayeli, abwira n’abagabisha b’ingabo zabazanye ati: “Nimuze muhonyoze ibirenge vyanyu ku mazosi y’aba bami.” Nuko baregera bahonyoza ibirenge vyabo ku mazosi yabo.<verse eid="JOS 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Yosuwa abwira abantu biwe ati: “Ntimuze mwigere mugira ubwoba canke ngo mucike intege. Mushikame mwambare inkomezi. Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokorera abansi bose mugiye kuzogwanya.” <verse eid="JOS 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Hanyuma Yosuwa aca yica abo bami uko ari batanu, aca abamanika ku biti, bagumaho gushika bwije.<verse eid="JOS 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Izuba rirenze, Yosuwa aca atanga itegeko ryo kubamanura, babata muri ca kinogo kiri musi y’ikibuye kinini bari binyegejemwo. Mu rwinjiriro rw’ico kinogo baca bahugaza ikibuye kinini, kandi ni ho kikiri gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abisirayeli bafata ibisagara vyo mu bumanuko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Uwo musi nyene, Yosuwa afata igisagara ca Makeda aragisambura. Yicisha inkota abakibamwo bose harimwo n’umwami waho, ntiyasiga n’umwe. Yarabaranduye bose, agirira umwami w’i Makeda ivyo yagiriye umwami w’i Yeriko.<verse eid="JOS 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />Inyuma y’aho, Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli baciye bava i Makeda baja i Libuna, barahatera. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />Na ho nyene <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atanga igisagara n’umwami waho mu maboko y’Abisirayeli. Yosuwa yicisha inkota abo muri ico gisagara n’abakibamwo, ntiyasiga n’umwe wo kuvuga inkuru. Umwami waho amugirira nk’ivyo yagiriye uw’i Yeriko.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli bose bava i Libuna baja i Lakishi, barahatera. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atanga Lakishi mu maboko y’Abisirayeli. Yosuwa ahafata ku musi ugira kabiri. Abo mu gisagara bose abaranduza inkota, nk’uko yari yabikoze i Libuna. <verse eid="JOS 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />Kandi ico gihe, Horamu umwami w’i Gezeri, yari yaje gufasha uw’i Lakishi, ariko Yosuwa amuneshanya n’ingabo ziwe, ntiharokoka n’umwe.<verse eid="JOS 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli baca bava i Lakishi baja muri Eguloni, barahatera. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Bahafata uwo musi nyene, bicisha inkota abantu bose bahaba, barabahonya, nk’uko bari babigize i Lakishi.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli bose bava muri Eguloni, baduga i Heburoni, barahatera. <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />Bafata ico gisagara bacisha inkota abantu bose, harimwo umwami waho, imihana yaho n’abayibamwo bose. Nta n’umwe basigaje. Kandi nk’uko yari yabigize muri Eguloni yica abantu bose bahaba.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Inyuma y’aho Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli bose barahindukira batera i Debiri. <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />Bafata ico gisagara n’umwami waho, n’imihana yaho, babicisha inkota. Abahaba bose barabishe ntibasiga n’umwe. Akorera Debiri n’umwami waho nk’ivyo yakoreye i Libuna n’umwami waho, co kimwe na Heburoni.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Uko ni ko Yosuwa yafashe ivyo bihugu vyose vyo mu karere k’imisozi miremire, i Negebu, mu biyaya vyo mu burengero biri musi y’imisozi hamwe n’imimanuko yayo, abifatana n’abami baho. Ntiyasize n’umwe. Yatikije igihumeka cose nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana y’Abisirayeli yari yarabimubwiye. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Yosuwa arabarandura bose uhereye i Kadeshi Baruneya gushika i Gaza, no mu ntara yose kuva i Gosheni gushika i Gibeyoni. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />Ivyo bihugu n’abo bami bose Yosuwa abafata mu gitero kimwe yagize kuri bo, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana y’Abisirayeli ari yo yabagwanira.<verse eid="JOS 10:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Maze Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli bose barahindukira basubira mu mahema yabo i Gilugali.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yosuwa atsinda abami bo mu buraruko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />Yabini umwami w’i Hazori avyumvise, aca arungikira intumwa Yobabu umwami w’i Madoni, abami b’i Shimuroni n’umwami w’i Akishafu, <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />abami bo mu karere k’imisozi miremire mu buraruko, abo mu kiyaya Araba mu bumanuko bw’i Kinereti, abo mu kiyaya n’ab’i Nafoti Dori mu burengero, <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />n’Abanyakanani mu buseruko no mu burengero; n’Abamori, n’Abaheti, n’Abaperizi, n’Abayebusi bo mu gihugu c’imisozi miremire, hamwe n’Abahiwi bo musi ya Herumoni mu ntara ya Misipa. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Bose baza n’ingabo zabo zose, n’amafarasi menshi, n’imikogote myinshi: bari benshi cane bameze kurya kw’umusenyi wo ku nkengera y’ikiyaga. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Abo bami bose baja hamwe, bagira ikambi imwe ku mazi y’i Meromi kugira ngo batere Abisirayeli.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yosuwa ati: “Ntubatinye kuko ejo nk’aya masaha nzobatanga mu maboko y’Abisirayeli bameze nk’abapfuye. Muzotemagure ibinono vy’amafarasi yabo, muturire n’imikogote yabo.”<verse eid="JOS 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Nuko Yosuwa n’ingabo ziwe zose baja kubagwanya, babatera giturumbuka babasanze aho bari ku mazi y’i Meromi, <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abatanga mu maboko ya Isirayeli. Abisirayeli barabatsinda, barabirukana gushika mu ntara nini y’i Sidoni, ahitwa Misirefoti-Mayimu, no mu kiyaya ca Misipehi mu buseruko, barabica ntihasigara n’umwe. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Yosuwa abagirira nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yamubwiye: ifarasi bazicagagura ibinono, imikogote na yo barayiturira.<verse eid="JOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Ico gihe Yosuwa aca arahindukira afata Hazori, umwami waho amwicisha inkota. Hazori hari harigeze kuba umugwa mukuru w’ubwo bwami bwose. <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Ababa muri ico gisagara bose bicishwa inkota, barabahonya ntibasigaza umuntu n’umwe agihema, bongera baturira Hazori.<verse eid="JOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Yosuwa afata ivyo bisagara n’abami bavyo, abicisha inkota, arabahonya bose nk’uko Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabimutegetse. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Ariko Abisirayeli ntibaturiye ibindi bisagara vyose vyo mu misozi, kiretse Hazori conyene caturiwe na Yosuwa. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Abisirayeli basahura ibintu vyose vyo muri ivyo bisagara harimwo n’ibitungwa, barabitwara, ariko abantu bo muri vyo bose babicisha inkota, ntibasigaza n’umwe. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />Ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabitegetse umusavyi wiwe Mose, kandi Mose na we yabitegetse Yosuwa, hanyuma Yosuwa na we arabishitsa. Nta kintu na kimwe atakoze mu vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse Mose.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Maze Yosuwa afata igihugu cose: ahari imisozi miremire, intara ya Negebu yose, intara yose ya Gosheni, hamwe n’intara zigizwe n’imisozi migufimigufi yo mu burengero, ikiyaya Araba n’imisozi ya Isirayeli iri kumwe n’imyonga yayo, <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17" />kuva ku musozi Halaki uduga utumbereye i Seyiri, gushika i Bayali-Gadi mu kiyaya c’i Libani hepfo y’umusozi Herumoni. Afata abami baho bose arabica. <verse eid="JOS 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18" />Yosuwa yamaze igihe kinini agira ibitero kuri abo bami. <verse eid="JOS 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />Kiretse Abahiwi baba i Gibeyoni bonyene, nta gisagara na kimwe kindi cigeze gisaba ko bogiriranira isezerano ry’amahoro n’Abisirayeli, ibisagara vyose yabifashe habanje kuba intambara. <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yakomantaje imitima yabo ngo batere Abisirayeli, kugira ngo Abisirayeli na bo babahonye bose, babatikize ata kigongwe, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabitegetse Mose.<verse eid="JOS 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />Ico gihe Yosuwa aca aragenda atikiza Abanaki bo mu gihugu c’imisozi miremire: kuva i Heburoni, i Debiri n’i Anabu, kuva mu ntara y’imisozi miremire y’i Buyuda, no kuva mu ntara y’imisozi miremire ya Isirayeli. Yosuwa arabahonya bose hamwe n’ibisagara vyabo. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Nta muntu wo mu ba Anaki n’umwe yasigaye muri ico gihugu ca Isirayeli, kiretse abari i Gaza, i Gati no muri Ashidodi.<verse eid="JOS 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Nuko Yosuwa afata ico gihugu cose nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabitegetse Mose, akigaburira Abisirayeli nk’iragi ryabo, akibagaburira uko imiryango yabo ingana. Maze igihugu kibona kuruhuka intambara.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s1">Abami batsinzwe bo mu buseruko bwa Yorodani</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />Aba ni bo bami b’ibihugu Abisirayeli banesheje bagafata ibihugu vyabo biri mu buseruko bwa Yorodani, uvuye ku kagezi k’uruzi Arunoni ugashika ku musozi Herumoni, harimwo igice c’amaja mu buseruko bw’ikiyaya Araba.<verse eid="JOS 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Sihoni umwami w’Abamori yaba i Heshiboni.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 12:2">Yaganza kuva i Aroweri ku nkengera y’akagezi k’uruzi Arunoni ugashika ku ruzi Yaboki, ari na rwo rwari urubibe rw’Abamoni. Aho harimwo n’igice c’intara ya Gileyadi.<verse eid="JOS 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />Yatwara kandi no mu buseruko bw’ikiyaya Araba uhereye ku Kiyaga c’i Galilaya gushika ku kiyaga ca Araba, ari co kiyaga kitagiramwo ibinyabuzima, n’i Beti-Yeshimoti, n’amaja mu bumanuko musi y’imisozi y’i Pisiga.<verse eid="JOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Umwami Ogi wa Bashani, umwe mu masigarira y’Abarefayimu, yatwara ahitwa Ashitaroti no muri Edireyi.<verse eid="JOS 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />Yatwara intara iva ku musozi Herumoni, Saleka, na Bashani yose mu buseruko, n’amaja mu burengero ku mbibe z’abantu b’i Geshuri n’i Mayaka, n’igice ca Gileyadi ugashika ku rubibe rwa Sihoni umwami w’i Heshiboni.<verse eid="JOS 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />Aho, Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we yahafashe ari kumwe n’Abisirayeli. Maze Mose umusavyi w’Imana ahagaburira imiryango ya Reyubeni n’iya Gadi, hamwe n’igice c’umuryango wa Manase ngo habe intara zabo.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Aba ni bo bami n’ibice vy’igihugu abo bami batwara aho Yosuwa n’Abisirayeli bafashe, mu burengero bwa Yorodani, kuva i Bayali-Gadi mu kiyaya ca Libani, gushika ku musozi Halaki, uduga utumbereye i Seyiri, Yosuwa yagaburiye ico gihugu imiryango y’Abisirayeli ngo kibe icabo bazokwamana. <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />Muri ico gihugu, hariho ahari imisozi miremire, ahari imisozi migufimigufi yo mu burengero, hakaba ikiyaya Araba, imimanuko y’imisozi, ubugaragwa bw’i Negebu, hamwe n’ibihugu vy’Abaheti, Abamori, Abanyakanani, Abaperizi, Abahiwi n’Abayebusi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 12:8" />
  <para style="lh" vid="JOS 12:8">Abami baneshejwe bari:<verse eid="JOS 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Umwami w’i Yeriko</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:9">Umwami w’i Hayi hafi y’i Beteli<verse eid="JOS 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />Umwami w’i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:10">Umwami w’i Heburoni<verse eid="JOS 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />Umwami w’i Yarimuti</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:11">Umwami w’i Lakishi<verse eid="JOS 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />Umwami w’i Eguloni</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:12">Umwami w’i Gezeri<verse eid="JOS 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />Umwami w’i Debiri</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:13">Umwami w’i Beti-Gaderi<verse eid="JOS 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />Umwami w’i Horuma</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:14">Umwami w’i Aradi<verse eid="JOS 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />Umwami w’i Libuna</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:15">Umwami w’i Adulamu<verse eid="JOS 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />Umwami w’i Makeda</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:16">Umwami w’i Beteli<verse eid="JOS 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />Umwami w’i Tapuwa</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:17">Umwami w’i Heferi<verse eid="JOS 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />Umwami w’i Afeki</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:18">Umwami w’i Lasharoni<verse eid="JOS 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />Umwami w’i Madoni</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:19">Umwami w’i Hazori<verse eid="JOS 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />Umwami w’i Shimuroni Meroni</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:20">Umwami w’i Akishafu<verse eid="JOS 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />Umwami w’i Tanaki</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:21">Umwami w’i Megido<verse eid="JOS 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />Umwami w’i Kedeshi</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:22">Umwami w’i Yokineyamu i Karumeli<verse eid="JOS 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />Umwami w’i Dori mu gisagara ca Nafoti Dori</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:23">Umwami w’i Goyimu i Gilugali<verse eid="JOS 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />Umwami w’i Tiriza.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 12:24" />
  <para style="lf" vid="JOS 12:24">Bose hamwe bari abami mirongo itatu n’umwe.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ibice vy’igihugu Abisirayeli batari bwigarurire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />Yosuwa amaze gusaza, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amubwira ati: “Uriko urasaza kandi haracariho igice kinini c’igihugu kitarafatwa.<verse eid="JOS 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />Ahari hagisigaye gufatwa ni aha:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 13:2" />
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 13:2">intara zose z’Abafilisitiya n’Abageshuri, <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />uhereye ku ruzi Shihori mu buseruko bwa Egiputa gushika mu ntara ya Ekuroni mu buraruko, kandi aho hose hitirirwa Abanyakanani naho hari higanziwe n’abatware batanu b’Abafilisitiya batwara Gaza, Ashidodi, Ashikeloni, Gati na Ekuroni;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 13:3">mu ntara y’Abavimu <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />mu bumanuko;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 13:4">intara yose y’Abanyakanani, uhereye muri Arahu ho mu Basidoni, gushika kure muri Afeki, no ku rubibe bahana n’intara y’Abamori;<verse eid="JOS 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />intara y’Abagebali;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 13:5">hamwe n’intara yose y’i Libani irimwo imisozi gushika mu buseruko, kuva i Bayali-Gadi ukamanuka hepfo y’umusozi Herumoni gushika i Lebo-Hamati.<verse eid="JOS 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" />Nayo ababa mu karerere k’imisozi miremire, uhereye i Libani ugashika i Misirefoti-Mayimu, ahaba Abanyesidoni hose, nzohabirukana jewe nyene imbere y’Abisirayeli. Ariko wewe urabe neza ko igihugu wakigaburiye Abisirayeli nk’iragi ryabo, kandi nk’uko nabikubwiye, <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />ukibagabure nk’iragi ry’Abisirayeli hagati y’imiryango icenda, n’igice c’umuryango wa Manase.”<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bagaburirwa igice co mu buseruko bwa Yorodani</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />Ikindi gice c’umuryango wa Manase, umuryango wa Reyubeni hamwe n’uwa Gadi bari bamaze kuronka iragi ryabo mu buseruko bwa Yorodani, kuko Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarahabagaburiye.<verse eid="JOS 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />Hari kuva ahitwa Aroweri no ku nkengera y’akagezi k’uruzi Arunoni, no kuva ku gisagara kiri hagati ahaherereye ako kagezi, ugashiramwo n’imisozi migufimigufi y’i Medeba ukagenda ugashika kure, ahitwa Diboni, <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />hamwe n’ibisagara vyose vya Sihoni umwami w’Abamori yatwara aba i Heshiboni, gushika ku rubibe rw’Abamoni.<verse eid="JOS 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />Harimwo kandi na Gileyadi, n’intara yarimwo abantu b’Abageshuri na Mayaka, umusozi Herumoni wose, Bashani yose gushika i Saleka, <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />hamwe n’ubwami bwose bwatwarwa na Ogi w’i Bashani yatwariye i Ashitaroti n’i Edireyi, akaba ari n’umwe mu bami ba nyuma b’Abarefayimu. Mose yari yarabanesheje bose, abanyaga igihugu cabo. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Ariko Abisirayeli ntibigeze birukana abantu b’i Geshuri n’i Mayaka, bagumye babana n’Abisirayeli gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="JOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />Mugabo umuryango wa Lewi wowo nta ragi wahawe kuko ibimazi vyashikanwa ku bicaniro vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli, ni vyo vyari iragi ryabo, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabibasezeraniye.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Aha ni ho Mose yahaye umuryango wa Reyubeni akurikije abakuru b’inzu ziwugize:<verse eid="JOS 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />Intara iva kuri Aroweri no ku nkengera y’akagezi k’uruzi Arunoni, no kuva ku gisagara kiri hagati ahaherereye kuri ako kagezi, ugashiramwo n’imisozi migufimigufi y’i Medeba <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />hamwe na Heshiboni n’ibisagara vyaho vyo mu misozi migufimigufi, ushizemwo na Diboni, Bamoti-Bayali, Beti-Bayali-Meyoni, <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />Yahiza, Kedemoti, Mefayati, <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />Kiriyatayimu, Sibuma, Zereti-Shahari ku misozi no mu kiyaya, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />Beti-Peyori, ku mimanuko ya Pisiga, n’i Beti-Yeshimoti, <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />ibisagara vyo ku misozi migufimigufi hamwe n’ahantu hose Sihoni umwami w’Abamori yatwara ari i Heshiboni. Mose yaramutsinze hamwe n’abakuru b’Abamidiyani, ari bo Evi, Rekemu, Zuri, Huri na Reba, ari bo baganwa bo muri ico gihugu bari begamiye Sihoni. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />Muri abo bishwe n’Abisirayeli mu ntambara, harimwo umupfumu Balamu mwene Beyori, uwo bicishije inkota.<verse eid="JOS 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Urubibe rw’umuryango wa Reyubeni rwari rugizwe n’inkengera ya Yorodani. Ibi bisagara n’imihana yaho ni vyo vyatanzwe nk’iragi ku muryango wa Reyubeni, hakurikijwe abakuru b’ingo ziwugize.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Aha ni ho Mose yahaye umuryango wa Gadi, hakurikijwe abakuru b’inzu ziwugize:<verse eid="JOS 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />Intara yabo yari igizwe na Yazeri, ibisagara vyose vy’i Gileyadi, n’igice c’igihugu c’Abamoni gushika i Aroweri hafi y’i Raba <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />hamwe no kuva i Heshiboni kugeza i Rama Misipehi n’i Betonimu, hakongera hakava i Mahanayimu hagashika i Debiri. <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />Kandi no mu kiyaya bahawe Beti-Haramu, Beti-Nimura, Sukoti, Zafoni, n’igice c’ubwami bwa Sihoni yatwara ari i Heshiboni, uruhande rwo mu burengero rwa Yorodani, intara iduga igashika aho Ikiyaga c’i Kinereti giherera.<verse eid="JOS 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Ivyo bisagara n’imihana ivyegamiye ni vyo vyahawe umuryango wa Gadi nk’iragi, hakurikijwe abakuru b’inzu zigize uwo muryango.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Ibi ni vyo Mose yahaye igice c’umuryango wa Manase, ni ukuvuga igice c’abantu bakomoka kuri Manase ukurikije abakuru b’inzu ziwugize:<verse eid="JOS 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />Intara iva i Mahanayimu, hakajamwo n’i Bashani hose, akarere kose k’umwami Ogi w’i Bashani, hamwe n’ibisagara mirongo itandatu vy’i Bashani vyatwarwa na Yayiro. <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />Bahawe kandi n’igice ca Gileyadi, n’ibisagara vya Ashitaroti na Edireyi, ibisagara vy’umwami Ogi i Bashani.</para>
  <para style="lf" vid="JOS 13:31">Ivyo vyose ni vyo vyahawe uruvyaro rwa Makiri, mwene Manase ku bw’igice c’abahungu ba Makiri, ukurikije abakuru b’ingo zigize uwo muryango.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Izo ni zo ntara Mose yatanze nk’iragi igihe yari mu kiyaya c’i Mowabu hafi y’uruzi Yorodani mu buseruko bwa Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" />Ariko umuryango wa Lewi nta ragi Mose yawuhaye, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli ari we ragi ryabo, nk’uko yabibasezeraniye.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s1">Bagabura igihugu co mu burengero bwa Yorodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Izi ni zo ntara imiryango y’Abisirayeli yari isigaye yahawe nk’iragi ryabo mu gihugu c’i Kanani, bahagaburiwe n’umuherezi Eliyazeri, ari kumwe na Yosuwa mwene Nuni, n’abakuru b’imiryango ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" />Imiryango icenda n’igice ni yo yahawe intara hakoreshejwe ubupfindo nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabitegetse aciye kuri Mose. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3" />Mose yari yaramaze gutanga iragi ku miryango ibiri n’igice ayiha mu buseruko bwa Yorodani ariko Abalewi nta ragi na rimwe bahawe nk’iyindi miryango. <verse eid="JOS 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4" />Abahungu babiri ba Yosefu bavuyemwo imiryango ibiri ari yo Manase na Efurayimu. Abalewi nta mugabane w’intara baronse ariko bahawe ibisagara vyo kubamwo, hamwe n’uburagiro bw’ibitungwa vyabo. <verse eid="JOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" />Nuko Abisirayeli bagaburirwa ico gihugu nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabitegetse Mose.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intara yahawe Kalebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />Umusi umwe abantu bo mu muryango wa Yuda bagendera Yosuwa i Gilugali, barongowe na Kalebu mwene Yefune w’Umukenizi. Kalebu abarira Yosuwa ati: “Wibuke ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabwiye Mose umusavyi w’Imana kuri wewe nanje igihe twari i Kadeshi Baruneya. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />Nari mfise imyaka mirongo ine igihe Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yandungika gutata iki gihugu mva i Kadeshi Baruneya. Namubwiye inkuru nkurikije uko navyumva mu mutima, <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />mugabo benewacu twaduganye batumye imitima y’abantu iranduka kubera ubwoba. Ariko jewe nakurikiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje n’umutima wanje wose. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />Uwo musi rero, Mose yararahiye ati: ‘Aho ibirenge vyawe vyahonyoye muri ico gihugu hazoba iragi ryawe n’uruvyaro rwawe ibihe vyose, kuko wakurikiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje n’umutima wawe wose.’<verse eid="JOS 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />None rero, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabinsezeraniye, yarazigamye ubugingo bwanje imyaka mirongo ine n’itanu kuva igihe yabwira Mose ivyo, igihe Abisirayeli bariko barayerera mu bugaragwa. Uyu musi maze imyaka mirongo umunani n’itanu. <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />Ndacafise inkomezi nk’izo nari mfise igihe Mose yandungika, kandi ndacaja mu ntambara nk’uko nari meze ico gihe. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />None rero ndasavye umpe iki gihugu c’imisozi miremire nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabinsezeraniye uwo musi. Na wewe nyene wariyumviye ko Abanaki ari bo bahaba kandi ko n’ibisagara vyabo bizitiriwe cane. Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> niyabana nanje nzobirukana nk’uko yabivuze.”<verse eid="JOS 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Maze Yosuwa ahezagira Kalebu mwene Yefune, amuha Heburoni nk’iragi ryiwe. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />Nuko Heburoni hegukira Kalebu mwene Yefune Umukenizi kuva ico gihe, kuko yubashe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli n’umutima wiwe wose. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />Heburoni hahora hitwa Kiriyati-Araba. Hiswe uko kubera Araba, umuhizi yakomoka kuri Anaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 14:15">Maze iyo ntara iraruhuka intambara iba amahoro.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s1">Intara yahawe Yuda</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Intara yahawe umuryango wa Yuda, ukurikije abakuru b’inzu zigize uwo muryango, yaramanuka igashika ku ntara y’abakomoka kuri Edomu ikabandanya gushika mu bugaragwa bw’i Zini kure cane uja mu bumanuko.<verse eid="JOS 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />Urubibe rwaho rwo mu bumanuko rwava ku Kiyaga c’Umunyu, <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />rugaca mu bumanuko bw’ahitwa Akurabimu, rukabandanya gushika i Zini, rukarenga no mu bumanuko bwa Kadeshi Baruneya rugashika i Hezironi hanyuma rukaduga gushika Adari, rugaca ruzunguruka ruja i Karuka. <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />Kuva aho rugaca rurengana Azimoni rugashika ku kagezi ka Egiputa, kisuka mu Kiyaga Mediterane. Urwo ni rwo rubibe rwabo rw’amaja mu bumanuko.<verse eid="JOS 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Urubibe rwo mu buseruko rwava ku Kiyaga c’Umunyu rugashika aho Yorodani rwisukira muri ico kiyaga.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 15:5">Amaja mu buraruko na ho rwava kw’isonga ry’ikiyaga rugashika aho Yorodani rwisukira muri ico kiyaga c’umunyu, <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />rukaduga rukaja i Beti-Hogila rukabandanya mu buraruko bwa Beti-Araba rugashika kw’ibuye rya Bohani, mwene Reyubeni. <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Uvuye ngaho, urwo rubibe ruca ruduga i Debiri hanyuma ruvuye mu kiyaya ca Akori rugaca rukevya rukaja mu buraruko bwa Gilugali aharabana na Adumimu mu bumanuko bw’ikiyaya. Rugaca rubandanya ruja ku mazi ya Eni-Shemeshi rugashika kuri Eni-Rogeli. <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />Maze rugaca ruduga ruciye mu kiyaya ca Beni-Hinomu rukagenda rukika hepfo y’imimanuko iri ahari igisagara c’Abayebusi ari co Yerusalemu. Kuva aho rugaca ruduga ku mitwe y’imisozi, n’ikiyaya ca Beni-Hinomu mu buraruko bw’ikiyaya ca Refayimu. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Ruvuye kuri iyo misozi, urwo rubibe ruca ruhindukira rukaja ku mariba y’i Nefutowa, rugaserukira mu bisagara vyo ku musozi Efuroni, hanyuma rukamanuka ruja i Bayala, ari ho i Kiriyati-Yeyarimu. <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />Ruca ruhindukira ruva mu burengero bwa Bayala ruja ku musozi Seyiri, rugaca ku mimanuko y’umusozi Yeyarimu ari ho Kesalini, rukabandanya rumanuka gushika i Beti-Shemeshi rukajabuka ruja i Timuna. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />Ruca rubandanya rugaca mu buraruko bw’imimanuko ya Ekuroni, rugahindukira rukaraba i Shikeroni, rugaca ku musozi Bayala rugashika i Yabuneli. Urwo rubibe rukagarukira ku Kiyaga Mediterane.<verse eid="JOS 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Urubibe rwo mu burengero ni aho Ikiyaga Mediterane kigarukira.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 15:12" />
  <para style="lf" vid="JOS 15:12">Izo ni zo mbibe z’imiryango ya Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />Akurikije uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamutegetse, Yosuwa yahaye Kalebu mwene Yefune igice c’itongo mu mugabane wa Yuda, aho ni Kiriyati-Araba, ari ho Heburoni, hari hiswe iryo zina Araba kubera sekuruza w’Abanaki. <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Nuko i Heburoni, Kalebu ahirukana imigwi itatu y’Abanaki ari bo ruvyaro rwa Sheshayi, urwa Ahimani n’urwa Talumayi, bene Anaki. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Avuye aho aca aja gutera abantu baba i Debiri ahahora hitwa Kiriyati-Seferi. <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Maze Kalebu aravuga ati: “Uwuzotera i Kiriyati-Seferi akahafata, nzomuha umukobwa wanje Akisa abe umugore wiwe.” <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Otiniyeli mwene Kenazi, avukana na Kalebu, arahafata; Kalebu aca amushingira umukobwa wiwe Akisa.<verse eid="JOS 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />Akisa amaze kuba umugore wa Otiniyeli, aca amubwira ngo asabe se itongo. Akisa yururutse indogoba yiwe, Kalebu aramubaza ati: “Wipfuza iki?”<verse eid="JOS 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Akisa amwishura ati: “Ngirira ubuntu. Ko wampaye itongo i Negebu, mpa n’amariba y’amazi.” Nuko Kalebu amuha amariba yo hepfo n’ayo haruguru.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Iri ni ryo ragi ry’umuryango wa Yuda, ukurikije uko abakuru b’inzu ziwugize zimeze:<verse eid="JOS 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Ibisagara vy’epfo cane mu bumanuko vy’umuryango wa Yuda mu gice citwa Negebu amaja ku rubibe rwa Edomu vyari ibi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 15:21">Kabuzeyeli, Ederi, Yaguri, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />Kinahi, Dimonahi, Adadahi, <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />Kedeshi, Hazori, Itinani, <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />Zifu, Telemu, Beyaloti, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />Hazori-Hadata, Keriyoti Hezironi ari co Hazori, <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />Amamu, Shema, Molada, <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />Hazari-Gadahi, Heshimoni, Beti-Peleti, <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />Hazari-Shuwali, Berisheba, Biziyotiya, <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />Bayala, Iyimu, Ezemu, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />Elitoladi, Kesili, Horuma, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />Zikulagi, Madumana, Sansanahi, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />Lebiti, Shilihimu, Ayini na Rimoni. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara mirongo ibiri n’icenda, biri kumwe n’imihana yavyo.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />Mu biyaya vyo mu burengero hari:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 15:33">Eshitayoli, Zora, Ashina, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />Zanowa, Eni-Ganimu, Tapuwa, Enamu, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />Yarimuti, Adulamu, Soko, Azeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />Shayarayimu, Aditayimu na Gedera canke Gederotayimu. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara icumi na bine n’imihana yari ibikikuje.<verse eid="JOS 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Zanani, Hadasha, Migidali-Gadi, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />Dileyani, Misipehi, Yokiteheli, <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />Lakishi, Bozikati, Eguloni, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />Gaboni, Lahamasi, Kitilishi, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />Gederoti, Beti-Dagoni, Nama na Makeda, vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara icumi na bitandatu, biri kumwe n’imihana yari ibikikuje.<verse eid="JOS 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Libuna, Etiheri, Ashani, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />Ifuta, Ashina, Nezibu, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />Keyila, Akizibu na Maresha, vyose uko ari ibisagara icenda hamwe n’imihana yari ibikikuje.<verse eid="JOS 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Igisagara Ekuroni n’ivyagikomokako vyose, n’imihana yaco yose, <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />Ibisagara vyose vyo mu ntara ya Ashidodi, mu burengero bwa Ekuroni, n’imihana yaho yose. <verse eid="JOS 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Ashidodi, n’imihana ihakikuje, Gaza n’imihana yaho, gushika ku kagezi ka Egiputa, n’inkengera z’ikiyaga Mediterane.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />Mu ntara igizwe n’imitumba miremire hari:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 15:48">Shamiri, Yatiri, Soko, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />Dana, Kiriyati-Sanahi ari yo Debiri, <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />Anabu, Eshitemo, Animu, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />Gosheni, Holoni na Gilo. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara icumi na bibiri, n’imihana yari ibikikuje.<verse eid="JOS 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Araba, Duma, Eshani, <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />Yanimu, Beti-Tapuwa, Afeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />Humuta, Kiriyati-Araba ari yo Heburoni, na Ziyori. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara icenda, n’imihana yari ibikikuje.<verse eid="JOS 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Mayoni, Karumeli, Zifu, Yuta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />Yezireyeli, Yokodiyamu, Zanowa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />Kayini, Gibeya na Timuna. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara icumi, n’imihana yari ibikikuje yose.<verse eid="JOS 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Halihuli, Beti-Zuri, Gedori, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />Mayarati, Beti-Anoti, na Elitekoni. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bitandatu n’imihana yavyo yose.<verse eid="JOS 15:59" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Kiriyati-Bayali ari co Kiriyati-Yeyarimu na Raba. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bibiri n’imihana yari ibikikuje yose.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />Mu bugaragwa hari:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 15:61">Beti-Araba, Midini, Sekaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />Nibushani, Igisagara c’Umunyu, hamwe na Eni-Gedi. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bitandatu n’imihana yari ibikikuje.<verse eid="JOS 15:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />Ariko umuryango wa Yuda ntiwashoboye kwirukana Abayebusi baba mu gisagara ca Yerusalemu, ari na co gituma gushika n’uwu musi Abayebusi bakibana n’Abayuda.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s1">Intara zahawe Efurayimu na Manase</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Itongo ryahawe uruvyaro rwa Yosefu ryava kuri Yorodani, mu buseruko bw’amariba y’i Yeriko, rugaca mu bugaragwa mu ntara irimwo imisozi miremire ya Beteli. <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />Ruvuye i Beteli ari ho i Luzi, rwaca rujabuka rukaja mu ntara y’Abaruki muri Ataroti, <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />rukamanuka ruja mu burengero mu ntara y’Abafuleti rugashika mu ntara ya Beti-Horoni mu bumanuko, rukabandanya n’i Gezeri, rugashika ku Kiyaga Mediterane.<verse eid="JOS 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />Iryo ni ryo tongo ryahawe imiryango y’abahungu ba Yosefu, ari bo Manase na Efurayimu.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />Aha ni ho Efurayimu yahawe, ukurikije abakuru b’inzu zigize uwo muryango:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 16:5">Urubibe rw’umugabane bahawe rwava muri Ataroti Adari mu buseruko kuduga kugeza ruguru i Beti-Horoni, <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />rukabandanya kugeza ku Kiyaga Mediterane. Ruvuye i Mikimetati mu buraruko, rwaca ruhindukira rukaja mu buseruko ahitwa Tanati Shilo, ruciye mu buseruko bwa Yanowa. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Hanyuma rwaca rumanuka ruva i Yanowa ruja i Ataroti n’i Nayara, rugaca i Yeriko rugashika kuri Yorodani. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />Ruvuye i Tapuwa, rwaca ruja mu burengero kw’isumo ry’i Kana rugashika ku Kiyaga Mediterane. Iryo ni ryo ragi umuryango w’Abefurayimu wahawe ukurikije abakuru b’inzu zigize uwo muryango.<verse eid="JOS 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />Bari bahawe kandi n’ibisagara vyose n’imihana yari ibikikuje vyari vyabikiwe Abefurayimu mu mugabane w’abo kwa Manase.<verse eid="JOS 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" />Ntibirukanye Abanyakanani baba i Gezeri, gushika n’ubu Abanyakanani baracabana n’Abefurayimu, ariko babakorera nk’abaja.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />Iyi ni yo ntara yahawe umuryango wa Manase imfura ya Yosefu. Makiri, imfura ya Manase ari we sekuruza w’Abagileyadi, yahawe Gileyadi na Bashani, kuko Abagileyadi bari abahizi mu ntambara. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Aho hantu baronse hari hagenewe ikindi gice c’uwo muryango wa Manase; ugizwe n’abakuru b’inzu zo mu muryango ari bo: Abiyezeri, Heleki, Asiriyeli, Shekemu, Heferi na Shemida. Abo ni abandi bagabo bakomoka kuri Manase umuhungu wa Yosefu, ukurikije inzu baserukira.<verse eid="JOS 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Ico gihe Zelofehadi mwene Heferi, Heferi mwene Gileyadi, Gileyadi mwene Makiri, Makiri mwene Manase, ntiyari yaravyaye abahungu, yari yavyaye abakobwa gusa. Na bo bari aba: Mahala, Nowa, Hogula, Milika na Tiriza. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />Maze baragenda babwira umuherezi Eliyazeri, Yosuwa mwene Nuni, n’abatware, bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse Mose kuduha iragi muri benewacu.” Nuko Yosuwa aca abaha iragi co kimwe na benewabo, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabitegetse. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Iragi rya Manase ryose hamwe ryangana n’amatongo icumi, hongeweko n’amatongo ya Gileyadi na Bashani mu buseruko bwa Yorodani, <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />kuko abakobwa bo mu ruvyaro rwa Manase baronse itongo co kimwe na basaza babo. Itongo ry’i Gileyadi ryaciye ritwarwa n’uruvyaro rwa Manase rwari rusigaye.<verse eid="JOS 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />Intara Manase yahawe yava kwa Asheri igashika kwa Mikimetati, mu buseruko bwa Shekemu. Urubibe ruvuye aho rwashika mu bumanuko harimwo n’ahaba abantu b’i Eni-Tapuwa. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />Intara ikikuje igisagara ca Tapuwa yaganzwa n’Abamanase, ariko ico gisagara ubwaco kikaba cari ku rubibe rw’intara ya Manase kandi cegukira Abefurayimu. <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Hanyuma urwo rubibe rwaca rubandanya rugashika kw’isumo ry’i Kana. Aho hari ibisagara vya Efurayimu vyari kumwe n’ivya Manase, ariko urubibe rwa Manase rwari haruguru y’iryo sumo rugashika ku Kiyaga Mediterane. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Mu bumanuko, iyo ntara yari iya Efurayimu, mu buraruko ikaba iya Manase. Intara ya Manase yashika ku Kiyaga Mediterane, ikongera igahana urubibe n’intara ya Asheri mu buraruko, n’iya Isakari mu buseruko.<verse eid="JOS 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Mu ntara zahawe Isakari na Asheri, harimwo kandi n’ibisagara vyahawe Manase. Na vyo ni: Beti-Shani, Ibileyamu hamwe n’ababa i Dori, Eni-Dori, Tanaki na Megido, hamwe n’abari bahakikuje.<verse eid="JOS 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" />Ariko uruvyaro rwa Manase ntirwashoboye gufata ivyo bisagara, kuko Abanyakanani bagumye bahaba. <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />Ariko Abisirayeli bamaze kugwira bagakomera, baciye bagira Abanyakanani abagurano babo, ariko ntibabirukana bose.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Uruvyaro rwa Yosefu rubwira Yosuwa ruti: “Ni kubera iki waduhaye intara imwe nk’iragi turi benshi, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaraduhezagiye cane?”<verse eid="JOS 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Yosuwa arabishura ati: “Nimba muri benshi, kandi intara y’imisozi miremire ya Efurayimu ikaba itabakwiye, nimuduge mu kibira mwiyagurire amatongo mu gihugu c’Abaperizi n’Abarefayimu.”<verse eid="JOS 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Uruvyaro rwa Yosefu rumwishura ruti: “Igihugu c’imisozi ntikidukwiye kandi Abanyakanani baba mu kiyaya bafise imikogote y’ivyuma, co kimwe n’ababa i Beti-Shani n’abahakikuje hamwe n’abo mu kiyaya c’i Yezireyeli.”<verse eid="JOS 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Ariko Yosuwa abwira imiryango ya Yosefu ari bo Manase na Efurayimu ati: “Muri benshi kandi murakomeye. Ntimuzoronka intara imwe gusa <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />ahubwo muzohabwa n’ikibira kiri mu misozi miremire na co nyene. Genda mugitunganye imbibe muzishikane kure aho mushaka, hazoba ahanyu. Naho Abanyakanani bafise imikogote y’ivyuma kandi bakaba bakomeye, muzobirukana.”<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s1">Bagabura igihugu gisigaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />Abisirayeli bose bakoranira i Shilo haba ari ho bashinga Ihema ry’Ibonaniro, kandi ico gihugu cose cari gisigaye kiganzwa na bo. <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />Ariko hariho imiryango indwi y’Abisirayeli itari bwaronke iragi ryayo.<verse eid="JOS 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Nuko Yosuwa abarira Abisirayeli ati: “Mbega muzorindira gushika ryari kugira ngo mufate iki gihugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya ba sogokuruza yabahaye? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Nimuhitemwo abantu batatu batatu mu muryango wose, hanyuma ndabarungike kugendagenda ico gihugu, baheze bagire icegeranyo cereye iragi ryabo ryose hamwe, hanyuma bagaruke aho ndi. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />Ico gihugu baze bakigaburemwo ibice indwi. Yuda azogume mu ntara yiwe mu bumanuko, Yosefu na we mu buraruko. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" />Nimwamara kwandika ico cegeranyo c’ivyo bice indwi, nzoheza ngirire ubupfindo imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />Ariko Abalewi bobo nta ntara bazotorana muri mwebwe, kuko igikorwa c’ubuherezi c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari ryo ragi ryabo. Kandi Gadi na Reyubeni n’igice c’umuryango wa Manase baramaze kuronka iragi ryabo mu buseruko bwa Yorodani. Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarahabahaye.”<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Abantu bagira bave hasi ngo bagende kugira igicapo c’ico gihugu, Yosuwa arababwira ati: “Genda murabe neza ico gihugu, muheze mugire igicapo caco. Maze muzogaruke aho ndi, nzoheza nkoreshe ubupfindo ndi aha nyene i Shilo imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Ba bantu baca baragenda, baca muri ca gihugu cose. Bagira igicapo caco kigabuyemwo ibice indwi, berekana n’ibisagara biri mu gice cose. Baca bagira icegeranyo baraheza bagaruka aho Yosuwa ari mw’ikambi i Shilo.<verse eid="JOS 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Yosuwa araheza akoresha ubupfindo i Shilo imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, araheza akigaburira Abisirayeli akurikije uko imiryango yabo iri.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intara yahawe Benyamini</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Ubupfindo bwa mbere bwerekanye intara y’umuryango wa Benyamini n’abakuru b’inzu ziwugize. Yari hagati y’intara yahawe Yuda n’iyahawe Yosefu.<verse eid="JOS 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />Mu buraruko, urubibe rw’intara yabo rutangurira ku ruzi Yorodani, rugaca haruguru y’imimanuko ya Yeriko, rukagenda rutumbereye mu burengero rugaca mu misozi miremire no mu bugaragwa bwa Beti-Aveni. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />Ruvuye aho ruca ku mimanuko yo hepfo ya Luzi, ari yo Beteli, rukamanuka muri Atorati Adari, hepfo y’imisozi ya Beti-Horoni.<verse eid="JOS 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Ruvuye kuri iyo misozi irabana na Beti-Horoni mu bumanuko urwo rubibe ruca ruhindukira rukamanuka rukagenda rutumbereye mu burengero gushika i Kiriyati-Bayali, ari ho Kiriyati-Yeyarimu, igisagara c’Abayuda. Aho hari ku ruhande rw’amaja mu burengero.<verse eid="JOS 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Uruhande rwo mu bumanuko rutangurira hirya y’igisagara Kiriyati-Yeyarimu amaja mu burengero, rugaserukira ku mariba ya Nefutowa. <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />Urwo rubibe ruca rumanuka rugaca ku ntango y’imisozi irabana n’ikiyaya ca Beni-Hinomu, mu buraruko bw’ikiyaya ca Refayimu. Ruca rubandanya rukamanuka mu kiyaya ca Hinomu rugakikama musi y’imimanuko y’igisagara c’Abayebusi rugaca rushikira muri Eni-Rogeli. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Ruca ruhindukira rukaraba mu buraruko, rukaja muri Eni-Shemeshi rukabandanya i Geliloti, aharabana n’inzira ya Adumimu, rugaca rumanuka kw’ibuye rya Bohani mwene Reyubeni. <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />Ruca Rubandanya amaja mu buraruko ruciye ku mumanuko wa Beti-Araba rukabandanya rumanuka rugashika muri Araba. <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />Ruca ruduga rugaca haruguru y’umumanuko wa Beti-Hogila rugaserukira amaja mu buraruko bw’Ikiyaga c’Umunyu naho uruzi Yorodani rwisuka. Urwo ni rwo rwari urubibe rw’amaja mu bumanuko.<verse eid="JOS 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Yorodani ni rwo rwari urubibe rwo mu buseruko.</para>
  <para style="lf" vid="JOS 18:20">Izo ni zo mbibe zerekana impande zose z’umugabane warazwe umuryango wa Benyamini ku mpande zose.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Umuryango wa Benyamini n’abakuru b’inzu ziwukomokako, wahawe ibisagara bikurikira:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 18:21">Yeriko, Beti-Hogila, Emeki Kezizi, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />Beti-Araba Zemarayimu, Beteli, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />Avimu, Para, Ofura, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />Kefari-Amoni, Ofuni na Geba. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara icumi na bibiri hamwe n’imihana yari ibikikuje.<verse eid="JOS 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Hakabamwo na Gibeyoni, Rama, Beroti, <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />Misipehi, Kefira, Moza, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />Rekemu, Iripeli, Tarala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />Zela, Hayelefu, Yebusi ari co Yerusalemu, Gibeya na Kiriyati. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara icumi na bine biri kumwe n’imihana yari ibikikuje</para>
  <para style="lf" vid="JOS 18:28">Iryo ni ryo ryari iragi ry’umuryango wa Benyamini.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s1">Intara yahawe Simeyoni</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />Ubupfindo bwa kabiri bwerekana intara y’umuryango wa Simeyoni, n’abakuru b’inzu zigize uwo muryango. Iragi ryabo ryari hagati mu ntara ya Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" />Ryari rigizwe n’ibisagara:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:2">Berisheba ari co Sheba, Molada, <verse eid="JOS 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />Hazari-Shuwali, Bala, Ezemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />Elitoladi, Betuli, Horuma, <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />Zikulagi, Beti-Marukaboti, Hazari-Susa, <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />Beti-Lebayoti na Sharuheni. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara icumi na bitatu n’imihana yari ibikikuje.<verse eid="JOS 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />Harimwo Ayini, Rimoni, Eteri na Ashani. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bine biri kumwe n’imihana yari ibikikuje, <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />hakabamwo kandi n’imihana yose yari ikikuje ivyo bisagara, gushika i Bayalati-Beyeri, ari ho Rama h’i Negebu.</para>
  <para style="lf" vid="JOS 19:8">Iyo ntara ni yo yari umugabane w’umuryango wa Simeyoni. <verse eid="JOS 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />Umugabane wa Simeyoni wagabanijwe ku mugabane wa Yuda kubera yuko intara ya Yuda yari nini kurenza iyo bakeneye. Uko ni ko umuryango wa Simeyoni waronse iragi ryawo hagati mu ntara ya Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intara yahawe Zebuloni</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Ubupfindo bwa gatatu bwerekana intara y’umuryango wa Zebuloni, n’abakuru b’inzu zigize uwo muryango.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:10">Urubibe rw’uwo mugabane rwashika i Saridi. <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />Rwava aho rukagenda rutumbereye mu burengero, rukarengana Marala rugashika kuri Dabesheti, rukabandanya gushika ku mugezi wo mu buseruko bwa Yokineyamu. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />Ku rundi ruhande, rwava i Saridi rukaja mu buseruko mu ntara ya Kisiloti Tabori, rukabandanya gushika i Daberati rugashika i Yafiya. <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />Rwaca rubandanya ruja mu buseruko rugashika i Gati-Heferi no muri Eti-Kazini; rukava i Rimoni rugaca ruhindukira rukaraba i Neya. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />Ruvuye aho rwaca rubandanya rukazunguruka mu buraruko ruja i Hanatoni rugashika mu kiyaya ca Ifutahi-Eli.<verse eid="JOS 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />Ibisagara vyari muri iyo ntara vyari ibi: Kata, Nahalali, Shimuroni, Idala na Betelehemu. Vyari ibisagara icumi na bibiri biri kumwe n’imihana yari ibikikuje.<verse eid="JOS 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Ivyo bisagara n’iyo mihana ni vyo vyari iragi ry’umuryango wa Zebuloni, ukurikije abakuru b’inzu zigize uwo muryango.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intara yahawe Isakari</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Ubupfindo bwa kane bwerekanye intara y’umuryango wa Isakari, n’abakuru b’inzu zigize uwo muryango. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />Iyo ntara yari ifise:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:18">Yezireyeli, Kesuloti, Shunemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />Hafarayimu, Shiyoni, Anaharati, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />Rabiti, kishiyoni, Ebezi, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />Remeti, Eni-Ganimu, Eni-Hada, na Beti-Pazezi.<verse eid="JOS 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />Urwo rubibe rwarashika no kuri Tabori, Shahazuma na Beti-Shemeshi, rukagarukira kuri Yorodani.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:22">Vyari ibisagara icumi na bitandatu n’imihana yari ibikikuje.<verse eid="JOS 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Ivyo bisagara n’imihana ibikikuje ni vyo vyari umugabane w’umuryango wa Isakari.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intara yahawe umuryango wa Asheri</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Ubupfindo bwa gatanu bwerekanye intara y’umuryango wa Asheri, n’abakuru b’inzu zigize uwo muryango. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />Iyo ntara yarimwo:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:25">Helikati, Hali, Beteni, Akishafu, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />Alameleki, Amadi na Mishali. Mu burengero, urubibe rwaca kuri Karumeli na Shihori-Libunati. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />Rwaca ruhindukira rukaraba mu buseruko amaja i Beti-Dagoni, rugashikira Zebuloni n’ikiyaya ca Ifutahi-Eli, rugaca ruja mu buraruko i Beti-Emeki n’i Neyiyeli, hanyuma rugaca i buryo bwa Kabuli. <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />Rwaca rubandanya ruja muri Abudoni, i Rehobu, i Hamoni n’i Kana, rugashika i Sidoni, igisagara kinini. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />Rwaca ruhindukira rukaraba i Rama, rukaja ku gisagara kizitiye cane c’i Tiro, rugahindukira ruraba i Hosa, rukaja ku Kiyaga Mediterane mu ntara ya Akizibu, <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />Uma, na Efeki, na Rehobu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:30">Hari ibisagara mirongo ibiri na bibiri hamwe n’imihana yari ibikikuje.<verse eid="JOS 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Ivyo bisagara n’iyo mihana ni vyo vyahawe umuryango wa Asheri nk’iragi, hakurikijwe abakuru b’inzu ziwugize.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intara yahawe Nafutali</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Ubupfindo bwa gatandatu, bwerekanye intara yegukira umuryango wa Nafutali, hakurikijwe abakuru b’inzu ziwugize.<verse eid="JOS 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Urubibe rwawo rwava i Helefu, kuva ku giti kinini i Zayananimu, rugaca muri Adami Nekebu na Yabuneli ruja i Lakumu rukagarukira kuri Yorodani. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Mu burengero urwo rubibe rwaca kuri Azinoti Tabori rugashika kuri Hukoki. Mu bumanuko rwaca kwa Zebuloni, Asheri akaba mu burengero, nayo Yuda akaba mu buseruko kuri Yorodani.<verse eid="JOS 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Ibisagara vyari bizitiriwe vyari ibi: Zidimu, Zeri, Hamati, Rekati, Kinereti, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />Adama, Rama, Hazori, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />Kedeshi, Edireyi, Eni-Hazori, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />Yironi, Migidali-Eli, Horemu, Beti-Anati na Beti-Shemeshi.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:38">Vyari ibisagara icumi n’icenda hamwe n’imihana yose yari ibikikuje.<verse eid="JOS 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Ivyo ni vyo bisagara vyahawe umuryango wa Nafutali nk’iragi ryabo, ukurikije inzu zawo.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intara yahawe umuryango wa Dani</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Ubupfindo bw’indwi bwerekanye intara ibaye iy’umuryango wa Dani hakurikijwe abakuru b’inzu zigize uwo muryango. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />Intara bahawe yarimwo ibisagara bikurikira:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:41">Zora, Eshitayoli, Iri-Shemashi, <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />Shayalabini, Ayaloni, Itahila, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />Eloni, Timuna, Ekuroni, <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />Eliteke, Gibetoni, Bayalati, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />Yehudi, Beni-Beraki, Gati-Rimoni, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />Me Yarikoni na Rakoni, hamwe n’aharabana n’i Yopa.<verse eid="JOS 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" />Ariko ab’umuryango wa Dani ntivyaboroheye gufata intara yabo, ni ko kuduga bagatera Leshemu, bakahafata, bakamarisha inkota abahaba bose. Baca baba i Leshemu, bahita Dani, izina rya sekuruza wabo.<verse eid="JOS 19:47" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />Ivyo ni vyo bisagara n’imihana ibikikuje vyahawe umuryango wa Dani nk’iragi ryabo, hakurikijwe abakuru b’inzu zigize uwo muryango.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Itongo ryahawe Yosuwa</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />Iyo miryango yose ihejeje kugabangana igihugu, Abisirayeli baca baha Yosuwa mwene Nuni itongo mu yabo. <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" />Nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabitegetse, bamuha igisagara yabasavye ari co Timunati-Sera cari mu ntara y’imisozi miremire ya Efurayimu. Aca asubiramwo kwubaka ico gisagara, aba ari ho aba.<verse eid="JOS 19:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />Izo ni zo ntara umuherezi Eliyazeri, Yosuwa mwene Nuni hamwe n’abakuru barongoye imiryango y’Abisirayeli bagaburiye imiryango yose nk’imigabane bari i Shilo hakoreshejwe ubupfindo, bari imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu rwinjiriro rw’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro. Igikorwa co kugabura ico gihugu kiba kirarangiye.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ibisagara vy’ubuhungiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yosuwa ati: <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />“Barira Abisirayeli bategekanye ibisagara vy’ubuhungiro, nk’uko nabibategetse nciye kuri Mose, <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />kugira ngo nihagira uwica umuntu atabishaka canke atabiteguye, azoshobore kuronka aho ahungira uwuzoba ajejwe guhora amaraso mu muryango w’uwapfuye. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />Niyamara guhungira muri kimwe muri ivyo bisagara, azohagarare kw’irembo ryaco yiregure ku bakuru baco. Bazoheze bamwakire muri ico gisagara, bamuhe aho aba, abane na bo. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Uwujejwe guhora amaraso niyamukurikirana, ntibaze bamutange, kuko azoba yishe mugenziwe atabishaka, atahora ari umwansi wiwe. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Azogume muri ico gisagara gushika yumvirijwe n’ikoraniro, yongere arindire gushika umuherezi mukuru azoba ariho ico gihe apfuye. Ni ho azoheza agasubira mu gisagara ciwe, ico yari yahunze avamwo.”<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />Nuko baca bategekanya Kedeshi i Galilaya mu misozi iri mu ntara ya Nafutali, Shekemu mu misozi iri mu ntara ya Efurayimu, na Kiriyati-Araba ari co Heburoni, mu misozi iri mu ntara ya Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />Mu buseruko bwa Yorodani ahaherereye i Yeriko, bategekanya Bezeri mu bugaragwa no mu misozi migufimigufi mu muryango wa Reyubeni, Ramoti i Gileyadi mu muryango wa Gadi, n’i Golani i Bashani mu muryango wa Manase. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />Umwisirayeli wese canke umunyamahanga yabana n’Abisirayeli yishe umuntu atabishaka yaca ahungira muri ivyo bisagara vyateguriwe ico kugira ngo uwujejwe guhora amaraso y’umuryango ntahave amwica ataraburana imbere y’ikoraniro.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ibisagara vy’Abalewi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />Abakuru b’umuryango w’Abalewi begera umuherezi Eliyazeri, na Yosuwa mwene Nuni, hamwe n’abakuru b’iyindi miryango ya Isirayeli, <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" />bari i Shilo mu gihugu c’i Kanani, bababwira bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse Mose ko muzoduha ibisagara tubamwo, n’uburagiro bw’ibitungwa vyacu.”<verse eid="JOS 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Nuko, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabitegetse, Abisirayeli baca baha Abalewi ibisagara n’uburagiro bikurikira nk’iragi ryabo:<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Ubupfindo bwa mbere bwerekana umuryango wa bene Kohati hakurikijwe abakuru b’inzu ziwugize. Abalewi bakomoka kuri Aroni umuherezi bahabwa ibisagara icumi na bitatu mu vyari vyahawe Yuda, Simeyoni na Benyamini.<verse eid="JOS 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Abo mu ruvyaro rwa Kohati bari basigaye bahabwa nk’imigabane yabo ibisagara icumi mu vyari vyahawe imiryango ya Efurayimu, Dani, n’igice c’umuryango wa Manase.<verse eid="JOS 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Abo mu ruvyaro rwa Gerishoni bahawe nk’imigabane yabo ibisagara icumi na bitatu mu vyari vyahawe imiryango ya Isakari, Asheri, Nafutali, n’igice c’umuryango wa Manase w’i Bashani.<verse eid="JOS 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Abo mu ruvyaro rwa Merari bahabwa ibisagara icumi na bibiri mu vyari vyahawe imiryango ya Reyubeni, Gadi na Zebuloni.<verse eid="JOS 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Nuko Abisirayeli bashitsa ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse Mose, mu guha Abalewi ibisagara n’uburagiro bwavyo nk’uko ubupfindo bwagiye buravyerekana.<verse eid="JOS 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Bahawe ibisagara n’amazina yavyo mu miryango ya Yuda na Simeyoni. <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />Aya ni yo mazina y’ibisagara vyahawe uruvyaro rwa Aroni, bakomoka ku nzu ya Kohati Umulewi kuko ubupfindo ari bo bwerekanye ubwa mbere:<verse eid="JOS 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Kiriyati-Araba ari ho Heburoni, mu misozi miremire ya Yuda, hamwe n’uburagiro buhakikuje. Araba yari sekuruza wa Anaki. <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Ariko imirima n’imihana yari ikikuje ico gisagara vyari vyahawe Kalebu mwene Yefune nk’iragi ryiwe. <verse eid="JOS 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />Ibisagara bikurikira hamwe n’uburagiro bwavyo ni vyo vyahawe uruvyaro rw’umuherezi Aroni: Heburoni, igisagara c’ubuhungiro ku wishe umuntu atabishaka, Libuna, <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />Yatiri, Eshitemowa, <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />Holoni, Debiri, <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />Ayini, Yuta na Beti-Shemeshi. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara icenda n’uburagiro bwavyo, ni vyo bahawe muri iyi miryango ibiri.<verse eid="JOS 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />Ibisagara vyo mu muryango wa Benyamini babahaye ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:17">Gibeyoni, Geba, <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />Anatoti na Alumoni. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bine n’uburagiro bwavyo.<verse eid="JOS 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Ibisagara vyahawe abaherezi, ari rwo ruvyaro rwa Aroni, biri kumwe n’uburagiro bwavyo, vyose hamwe vyari icumi na bitatu.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Abakohati bari basigaye bo mu muryango wa Lewi bahawe nk’imigabane ibisagara bikurikira mu muryango wa Efurayimu:<verse eid="JOS 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Mu misozi miremire ya Efurayimu bahahawe:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:21">Shekemu, igisagara c’ubuhungiro ku wishe umuntu atabishaka; hamwe na Gezeri, <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />Kibuzayimu na Beti-Horoni. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bine biri kumwe n’uburagiro bwavyo.<verse eid="JOS 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />Ibisagara bikurikira n’uburagiro bwavyo ni vyo abaherezi bahawe mu muryango wa Dani:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:23">Eliteke, Gibetoni, <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />Ayaloni na Gati-Rimoni. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bine, biri kumwe n’uburagiro bwavyo.<verse eid="JOS 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />Mu gice c’umuryango wa Manase bahahawe:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:25">Tanaki na Gati-Rimoni, n’uburagiro bwavyo. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bibiri.<verse eid="JOS 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Ibisagara vyose hamwe vyahawe imiryango ya Kohati yari yasigaye vyari icumi n’uburagiro bwavyo.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Uruvyaro rwa Gerishoni, iyindi nzu yo mu muryango w’Abalewi, rwahawe ibisagara bikurikira n’uburagiro bwavyo:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 21:27">mu gice c’umuryango wa Manase:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:27">Golani kiri muri Bashani; igisagara c’ubuhungiro ku wishe umuntu atabishaka, na Beshitera, n’uburagiro bwavyo. Vyari ibisagara bibiri.<verse eid="JOS 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />Mu muryango wa Isakari, bahahawe ibisagara bikurikira biri kumwe n’uburagiro bwavyo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:28">Kishiyoni, Daberati, <verse eid="JOS 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />Yarimuti na Eni-Ganimu. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bine n’uburagiro bwavyo.<verse eid="JOS 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />Mu muryango wa Asheri, bahahawe ibisagara bikurikira biri kumwe n’uburagiro bwavyo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:30">Mishali, Abudoni, <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />Helikati na Rehobu. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bine n’uburagiro bwavyo.<verse eid="JOS 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />Mu muryango wa Nafutali bahawe ibisagara bikurikira biri kumwe n’uburagiro bwavyo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:32">Kedeshi muri Galilaya; igisagara c’ubuhungiro ku wishe umuntu atabishaka, Hamoti-Dori na Karitani. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bitatu biri kumwe n’uburagiro bwavyo.<verse eid="JOS 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Ibisagara vyose hamwe vyahawe imiryango y’Abagerishoni biri kumwe n’uburagiro bwavyo vyari icumi na bitatu.<verse eid="JOS 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />Abalewi bari bagisigaye, ari bo b’Abamerari bahawe ibisagara bikurikira n’uburagiro bwavyo:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 21:34">mu muryango wa Zebuloni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:34">Yokineyamu, Karuta, <verse eid="JOS 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />Dimina na Nahalali. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bine, n’uburagiro bwavyo.<verse eid="JOS 21:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />Mu muryango wa Reyubeni baronse ibisagara bikurikira biri kumwe n’uburagiro bwavyo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:36">Bezeri, Yahiza, <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />Kedemoti na Mefayati. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bine.<verse eid="JOS 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />Mu muryango wa Gadi bahawe ibisagara bikurikira biri kumwe n’uburagiro bwavyo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:38">Ramoti c’i Gileyadi; igisagara c’ubuhungiro ku wishe umuntu atabishaka, Mahanayimu, <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />Heshiboni na Yazeri. Vyose hamwe vyari ibisagara bine.<verse eid="JOS 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Ibisagara vyose vyahawe nk’imigabane imiryango y’Abalewi bo mu nzu ya bene Merari vyari icumi na bibiri.<verse eid="JOS 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" />Ibisagara vyahawe Abalewi mu gihugu cari cafashwe n’Abisirayeli vyari mirongo ine n’umunani, biri kumwe n’uburagiro bwavyo. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Igisagara kimwekimwe cose muri ivyo caba gifise uburagiro bugikikuje.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aha Isirayeli igihugu yari yararahiye ko azogiha ba sekuruza, baragifata kiba icabo, bakibamwo. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaha akaruhuko aho bari hose, nk’uko yari yarabirahiye ba sekuruza babo. Nta mwansi wabo n’umwe yashoboye kubahagarara imbere, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagumye atanga abansi babo mu maboko yabo. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />Nta sezerano ryiza na rimwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarasezeraniye Isirayeli ritashitse; ivyo yasezeranye vyose yarabishikijije.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s1">Abo mu miryango yo mu buseruko batahuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Ico gihe Yosuwa akoranya abo mu muryango wa Reyubeni n’uwa Gadi, hamwe n’igice c’uwa Manase <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" />ababwira ati: “Mwashikije ivyo Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabategetse vyose, kandi nanje mwaranyumviye mu vyo nabategetse vyose. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Kuko uhereye kera gushika n’ubu, mutigeze mutana urugamba benewanyu, ahubwo mwabandanije igikorwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabashinze. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />None rero ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ahaye akaruhuko benewanyu nk’uko yabisezeranye, nimwisubirire iwanyu, mu ntara Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabahaye mu buseruko bwa Yorodani. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Ariko muzokwame mwiyubara, mukurikize amabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe Mose umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabahaye: Mukunde <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, mugendere mu nzira ziwe, mushitse amabwirizwa yiwe, mwumire kuri we, kandi mumukorere n’imitima yanyu yose, n’imishaha yanyu yose.”<verse eid="JOS 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6" />Nuko Yosuwa arabahezagira, arabarungika, basubira iwabo. <verse eid="JOS 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7" />Igice kimwe c’umuryango wa Manase Mose yari yagihaye intara ya Bashani mu buseruko bwa Yorodani, ikindi gice Yosuwa yagihaye intara yo mu burengero bwa Yorodani. Igihe Yosuwa yariko arabarungika, yarabahezagiye, <verse eid="JOS 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8" />ababwira ati: “Nimusubire iwanyu mutwaye n’ubutunzi bwinshi mwanyaze abansi banyu: ibitungwa, ifeza, inzahabu, imyakaka, ivyuma, n’ivyambarwa vyinshi. Muzobigabure na benewanyu.”<verse eid="JOS 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Abo mu muryango wa Reyubeni n’uwa Gadi hamwe n’igice c’uwa Manase baca batandukanira n’abandi Bisirayeli i Shilo mu ntara ya Kanani, basubira i Gileyadi, mu ntara bahawe nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabitegetse abicishije kuri Mose.<verse eid="JOS 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />Bageze i Geliloti hafi ya Yorodani mu gihugu c’i Kanani, abo mu muryango wa Reyubeni n’uwa Gadi, n’ab’igice c’umuryango wa Manase baca bubaka igicaniro gisumba ibindi vyose. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />Abandi Bisirayeli bumvise ko umuryango wa Reyubeni n’uwa Gadi hamwe n’ab’igice c’umuryango wa Manase bubatse igicaniro ku rubibe rwa Kanani i Geliloti hafi ya Yorodani ku ruhande rwa Isirayeli, <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />bose baca bakoranira i Shilo kugira ngo baje kubatera.<verse eid="JOS 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Abisirayeli baca barungika Finehasi mwene Eliyazeri umuherezi, aja i Gileyadi mu miryango ya Reyubeni na Gadi n’igice c’umuryango wa Manase. <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />Bamurungikana n’abagabo icumi b’abatware, umwumwe ku muryango, hamwe n’umukuru umwemwe ku muce wose wo mu miryango ya Isirayeli.<verse eid="JOS 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Bashitse i Gileyadi, babarira imiryango ya Reyubeni na Gadi n’igice c’umuryango wa Manase bati: <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" />“Ikoraniro ryose ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rigize riti: ‘Ni kubera iki muhemukiye Imana ya Isirayeli ukwo? Ni iki catumye muva k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mukamugarariza mu kwiyubakira igicaniro? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" />Mbega icaha c’i Peyori nticari kimaze kuri twebwe? Gushika n’uwu musi ntituriyeza uko bikwiye, mbere n’inyuma y’uko ikiza caje ku bwoko bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>! <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />Mbega murahevye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>? Nimwagarariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uwu musi, ejo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azorakira Abisirayeli bose. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />Nimwakenera aho mwubaka igicaniro kubera intara yanyu ihumanye, muzoze mwifatanye natwe mu ntara y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahari ihema ry’ibonaniro ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, mubane natwe. Ariko ntimugararize <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu kwubaka ikindi gicaniro atari ca gicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" />Mbega igihe Akani mwene Zera yakora icaha mu kwiba ivyari vyagenewe kuba ivy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uburake bw’Imana ntibwaziriringiye Abisirayeli bose? Si we wenyene yapfuye azize ico caha.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Abo mu muryango wa Reyubeni n’uwa Gadi hamwe n’ab’igice c’umuryango wa Manase bishura abakuru b’imiryango y’Abisirayeli bati: <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana Ihambaye, ni we Mana wenyene! <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana Ihambaye, ni we Mana wenyene! Ni yo izi ukuri, kandi n’Abisirayeli na bo nibakumenye. Iki gicaniro ntitwacubatse mu kugarariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Nimba twacubatse mu bugarariji n’ukutumvira, Imana ntitureke ngo tubeho. <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Nimba twubatse igicaniro cacu kugira ngo tuve k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ngo tugishikanireko ibimazi vyo guturirwa, hamwe n’amashikanwa y’ifu canke amashikanwa y’ishimwe, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arabiduharurako.<verse eid="JOS 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />Haba na mba! Icatumye tucubaka ni ukugira ngo uruvyaro rwanyu ntiruzohave rubwira uruvyaro rwacu ruti: ‘Mbega mwebwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli muyisenga nka ba nde? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />Ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yashize hagati yacu uruzi Yorodani, mwebwe Abareyubeni n’Abagadi, nta co mupfana n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ Gutyo uruvyaro rwanyu rugatuma urwacu ruheba gutinya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JOS 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />Ni co catumye twibwira tuti: ‘Reka twubake igicaniro, ariko ntitugitangireko ibimazi.’ <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />Twashaka ko kiba icibutso gusa. Kizokwibutse uruvyaro rwanyu n’urwacu ko natwe dufise uburenganzira bwo gusenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu rusengero rwiwe, tugashikana amashikanwa yo guturirwa, ibimazi n’amashikanwa y’ishimwe. Ni ho uruvyaro rwanyu rutazobwira urwacu ruti: ‘Nta mugabane mufise k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’<verse eid="JOS 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />Kandi twibwira tuti nibatubwira gutyo canke bakabibwira uruvyaro rwacu, tuzobabwira tuti: ‘Ehe raba igicaniro kimeze nk’ic’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ba sogokuruza bacu bubatse. Si ico guturirirako amashikanwa canke gushikanirako ibimazi; ni icabona hagati ya twebwe na mwebwe.’<verse eid="JOS 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />Ntibikabe ko tugarariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu kwiyubakira igicaniro co gushikanirako amashikanwa yo guturirwa, amashikanwa y’ifu hamwe n’amashikanwa y’ishimwe; atari ku gicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu kiri imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro ryayo.”<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Finehasi umuherezi hamwe n’abarongozi b’umuryango wa Isirayeli ari bo barongoye imice igize imiryango yose bumvise ivyo abo mu muryango wa Reyubeni, n’abo mu muryango wa Gadi n’ab’igice c’uwa Manase bababwiye, baranezerwa cane. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />Finehasi mwene Eliyazeri umuherezi abwira abo mu muryango wa Reyubeni, n’abo mu muryango wa Gadi n’ab’igice c’uwa Manase ati: “Uyu musi dutahuye ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kumwe natwe, kuko mutakoze ibikorwa vyo kugarariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’uko twavyibaza. Mukijije Isirayeli ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="JOS 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Maze Finehasi mwene Eliyazeri umuherezi hamwe n’abo barongozi baca basezera imiryango ya Reyubeni na Gadi, bava muri iyo ntara ya Gileyadi, basubira i Kanani, biganira abandi Bisirayeli ivyabaye. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Na bo bavyumvise barahimbarwa, bashima Imana. Ntibaba baciyumvira ivyo gutera imiryango ya Reyubeni na Gadi ngo bazimanganye igihugu babamwo.<verse eid="JOS 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Maze abo mu muryango wa Reyubeni n’uwa Gadi baca bita izina ico gicaniro rivuga riti: “Icabona hagati yacu ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari we Mana.”<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s1">Amajambo ya nyuma ya Yosuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Inyuma y’igihe kirekire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahaye amahoro Abisirayeli akabakiza abansi babo bose bari babakikuje, Yosuwa yari ageze mu zabukuru. <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />Nuko akoranya Abisirayeli bose; abatware bose, abarongozi n’abacamanza arababwira ati: “Ehe raba ndageze mu zabukuru. <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />Mwese mwarabonye ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakoreye aya mahanga yose ku bwanyu; <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ni yo yabagwaniye. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />Mwibuke ingene nagaburiye imiryango yanyu intara mwahawe nk’imigabane, igihugu cose twafashe n’ico tutarafata, kuva kuri Yorodani gushika ku Kiyaga Mediterane mu burengero. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" />Iki gihugu kizoba icanyu, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu we nyene azokwiyirukanira ayo mahanga abahunge. Azobirukana imbere yanyu namwe mufate igihugu cabo, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabibasezeraniye.<verse eid="JOS 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />None rero mushire imitima yanyu ku vyanditswe muri iki gitabu c’ivyagezwe vya Mose, ntimuzohengamire i buryo canke i bubamfu. <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />Ntimuzokwifatanye n’ayandi mahanga akiri muri mwebwe, ntimuzokwambaze amazina y’imana zabo canke ngo murahire mu mazina yazo. Ntimuzozikorere canke ngo munazunamire. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Ariko mwumire k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu nk’uko mwayumiyeko gushika ubu.<verse eid="JOS 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yirukanye amahanga akomakomeye imbere yanyu, gushika ubu nta na rimwe rirabahagarara imbere. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" />Umwe muri mwebwe yirukana igihumbi, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu ari we abagwanira nk’uko yabibasezeraniye. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />None rero mushire imitima yanyu ku gukunda <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="JOS 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />Ariko nimwahindukira mukifatanya n’abacitse kw’icumu bo muri aya mahanga basigaye muri mwebwe canke mugahana abageni mukivanga na bo, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />mumenye ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atazokwirukana ayo mahanga imbere yanyu. Ariko bazobabera imitego muzogwamwo, bababere inkoni zo kubakubita mu migongo n’amahwa abazibura mu maso, gushika mutikiriye muri iki gihugu ciza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu abahaye.<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />Ehe ndi mu kwitaba Imana nk’uko bigendera abandi bose. Murazi n’imitima yanyu yose n’imishaha yanyu yose ko ata ciza na kimwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yasezeranye kitashitse. Ivyo yasezeranye vyose yarabishikije, nta na kimwe cavuyemwo. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" />Ariko nk’uko iciza cose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yasezeranye cashitse, ni ko n’ibibi vyose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuze bizoshika nimwamugarariza. Azobatikiza gushika muhonere muri iki gihugu ciza yabahaye. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Nimwaca kubiri n’isezerano <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yabahaye, mukunamira izindi mana mukazisenga, uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buzobaziriringira, muhonere bidatevye muri ico gihugu ciza yabahaye.”<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s1">Basubiramwo isezerano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Maze Yosuwa akoraniriza i Shekemu imiryango yose ya Isirayeli. Ahamagaza abakuru, abatware, abacamanza n’abarongozi, bose baza imbere y’Imana.<verse eid="JOS 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Yosuwa abarira abantu bose ati: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze: ‘Mu gihe ca kera, ba sogokuruza banyu, harimwo Tera se wa Aburahamu na Nahori, babaye hakurya y’uruzi Efurate kandi basenga izindi mana. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Ariko mfata sogokuruza Aburahamu ndamukura hakurya y’urwo ruzi ndamushikana i Kanani, ndamuha uruvyaro runini nciye kuri Isaka. <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" />Isaka namuhaye Yakobo na Esawu. Esawu namuhaye imisozi ya Seyiri ngo ayegukire, ariko Yakobo n’abana biwe ndabamanukana muri Egiputa.<verse eid="JOS 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" />Maze ntuma Mose na Aroni, nongera ntera ivyago Abanyegiputa, hanyuma ndabakura muri Egiputa. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" />Igihe nakura ba sogokuruza banyu muri Egiputa, mwashitse ku Kiyaga Gitukura, Abanyegiputa babakurikira bari ku mikogote no ku mafarasi. <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Ariko ba sogokuruza banyu batakambira jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngo ndabatabare, nca nsuka umwijima hagati yabo n’Abanyegiputa, ndabarenzako ikiyaga kirabatwara. Amaso yanyu yariboneye ivyo nakoreye Egiputa.<verse eid="JOS 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />Nabazanye mu gihugu c’Abamori baba mu buseruko bwa Yorodani. Barabagwanije, ariko ndabatanga mu maboko yanyu. Nabaranduye imbere yanyu, namwe mufata igihugu cabo. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" />Igihe Balaki mwene Zipori, umwami w’i Mowabu, yitegura ngo agwanye Abisirayeli, yarungitse Balamu mwene Beyori kubavuma. <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />Ariko sinumviriza Balamu, na we aho kubavuma arabahezagira, gutyo ndabakiza Balaki.<verse eid="JOS 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />Nuko mujabuka Yorodani mushika i Yeriko, abatware b’i Yeriko barabatera ngo babagwanye, nk’uko Abamori, Abaperizi, Abanyakanani, Abaheti, Abagirugashi, Abahiwi n’Abayebusi babigize. Ariko nabatanze mu maboko yanyu. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" />Narungitse amavubi imbere yanyu, yirukana abami babiri b’Abamori. Si inkota yanyu canke umuheto wanyu vyabahaye intsinzi. <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" />Nabahaye igihugu c’amatongo mutarimye, n’ibisagara mutubatse, mubibamwo, murya inzabibu n’imyelayo mutateye.’<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />None rero, nimwubahe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mumukorere mu kuri no mu bwizigirwa; mushire kure imana ba sogokuruza banyu bakoreye hakurya y’uruzi Efurate, no muri Egiputa, hanyuma mukorere <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Ariko nimba mudashaka gukorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nimwitorere uwu musi iyindi mana mukorera, zaba imana ba sogokuruza bakorera hakurya y’uruzi Efurate, zaba imana z’Abamori, abo mubereye mu gihugu. Ariko twe n’abo mu nzu yanje, tuzokorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="JOS 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Maze abantu bose bishura bati: “Guheba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> tugakorera izindi mana ntibikatubeko! <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu ni we yatwikuriye muri Egiputa twe na ba sogokuru bacu, mu gihugu c’ubuja, akorera ibitangaza n’ibimenyetso mu maso yacu. Yaturinze urugendo rwose atuzigamira mu mahanga yose twaciyemwo. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we yirukanye ayo mahanga yose imbere yacu, harimwo Abamori baba muri iki gihugu. None rero natwe tuzokorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko ni we Mana yacu wenyene.”<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Maze Yosuwa arababarira ati: “Mwebwe ntimushoboye gukorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko ni Imana itunganye kandi ipfuha. Ntizokwihanganira ubugarariji n’ivyaha vyanyu. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />Nimwava k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mugakorera izindi mana, azobateza ivyago bibatikize bibamare, inyuma y’ivyiza vyose yabagiriye.”<verse eid="JOS 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Na bo bishura Yosuwa bati: “Haba na mba! Tuzokorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="JOS 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Maze Yosuwa arababarira ati: “Mwebwe ubwanyu muri ivyabona vyanyu ko mwahisemwo gukorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” Na bo bati: “Egome turi ivyabona.”<verse eid="JOS 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />Yosuwa arababwira ati: “Nuko rero nimukure imana z’abanyamahanga ziri muri mwebwe, imitima yanyu muyegurire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli.”<verse eid="JOS 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Na bo bishura Yosuwa bati: “Tuzokorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu, twongere tumwubahe.”<verse eid="JOS 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Uwo musi nyene Yosuwa aca agirana isezerano n’abo bantu aho i Shekemu, aca abaha amabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Hanyuma Yosuwa aca yandika ivyo vyose mu gitabu c’ivyagezwe vy’Imana. Afata n’ibuye rinini ry’icibutso, arishira musi y’igiti kinini kiri hafi y’ihema ry’ibonaniro ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JOS 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Yosuwa ababwira ati: “Iri buye ni icabona hagati yacu. Ryumvise ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatubwiye vyose. Rizobacira urubanza nimwava ku Mana yanyu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Nuko Yosuwa aca arabarungika basubira iwabo, umwe wese aja mu ntara bahawe nk’iragi ryabo.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abahambwe mu gihugu c’isezerano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Inyuma y’ivyo vyose, Yosuwa mwene Nuni, umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, arahwera amaze imyaka ijana na cumi. <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />Bamuhamba mw’itongo yahawe i Timunati-Sera, mu ntara y’imisozi ya Efurayimu, haruguru y’umusozi Gayashi.<verse eid="JOS 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Abisirayeli bakorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu gihe cose Yosuwa yari akiriho no mu gihe c’abatware bakoranye na we, abo yasize amaze gupfa, hamwe n’abandi bose bari barabonye ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarakoreye Isirayeli.<verse eid="JOS 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />Na ya magufa ya Yosefu Abisirayeli bari baduganye bayakuye muri Egiputa baca bayahamba i Shekemu, mw’itongo Yakobo yari yaraguze ibiceri vy’ifeza ijana ahaguze na bene Hamori se wa Shekemu. Ryaciye riba iry’uruvyaro rwa Yosefu.<verse eid="JOS 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />Hanyuma Eliyazeri mwene Aroni arapfa, ahambwa i Gibeya, ahari hahawe umuhungu wiwe Finehasi mu gihugu c’imisozi miremire ca Efurayimu.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>